<!doctype lake><title>𝑮𝒆𝒏𝑨𝑰-𝑭𝒍𝒐𝒘-𝑰</title><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="adapt" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><meta name="defaultFontsize" content="16" /><h1 data-lake-id="M80oN" id="M80oN" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="ud74f8377" id="ud74f8377">🦨</span><span data-lake-id="u09506b98" id="u09506b98"> 𝑽𝒂𝒓𝒊𝒂𝒕𝒊𝒐𝒏𝒂𝒍 𝑰𝒏𝒇𝒆𝒓𝒆𝒏𝒄𝒆 𝒘𝒊𝒕𝒉 𝑵𝒐𝒓𝒎𝒂𝒍𝒊𝒛𝒊𝒏𝒈 𝑭𝒍𝒐𝒘𝒔</span></h1><p data-lake-id="uada3f50c" id="uada3f50c"><strong><span data-lake-id="u5c5eddca" id="u5c5eddca">变分推断通常需要用一类已知的概率分布去近似难以直接求解的真实后验分布，并在该分布族中寻找最优近似</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u3ed83acc" id="u3ed83acc">。然而，实际使用的近似分布族往往较为受限，例如均值场近似。这意味着，无论优化过程如何进行，最终得到的解都可能无法真正逼近真实后验分布。这也是变分方法经常受到批评的重要原因之一：</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u728bbeb3" id="u728bbeb3" style="color: #5C0036">不同于 MCMC 等其他推断方法，传统变分推断即使在渐近情形下，也通常无法恢复真实后验分布</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u9da16c0f" id="u9da16c0f"><strong><span data-lake-id="u6fe5856e" id="u6fe5856e">已有大量证据表明，更丰富、更忠实于真实后验的近似分布通常能够带来更好的性能</span></strong></p><ul list="u47e6eeb1"><li fid="u80160070" data-lake-id="uabab0efb" id="uabab0efb"><span data-lake-id="u2d48f54f" id="u2d48f54f">与采用均值场近似的 sigmoid belief networks 相比，深度自回归网络通过引入具有自回归依赖结构的后验近似，获得明显性能提升</span></li><li fid="u80160070" data-lake-id="u57012ceb" id="u57012ceb"><span data-lake-id="uf45a83c4" id="uf45a83c4">与此同时，也有许多研究揭示受限后验近似所带来的负面影响，Turner 和 Sahani 总结两个常见问题</span></li></ul><ul list="u47e6eeb1" data-lake-indent="1"><li fid="u80160070" data-lake-id="uc23d6f5d" id="uc23d6f5d"><span data-lake-id="uc4d516e9" id="uc4d516e9">其一，后验分布方差经常被低估，这可能导致预测质量下降，并使基于该后验近似所做出的决策变得不可靠</span></li><li fid="u80160070" data-lake-id="u2562b413" id="u2562b413"><span data-lake-id="ue532251d" id="ue532251d">其二，后验近似能力不足还可能导致模型参数的最大后验估计出现偏差，这一现象在时间序列模型中尤为明显</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ua8c8c5e5" id="ua8c8c5e5"><strong><span data-lake-id="u53df4a69" id="u53df4a69">为解决后验近似表达能力不足的问题，已有一些方法尝试构造更加丰富的后验近似</span></strong></p><ul list="u8ee8695b"><li fid="ua90f4c7e" data-lake-id="u07443d26" id="u07443d26"><span data-lake-id="u0026fd00" id="u0026fd00">这些方法通常基于结构化均值场近似，在近似后验内部引入某些基本形式的变量依赖关系</span></li><li fid="ua90f4c7e" data-lake-id="u88934e46" id="u88934e46"><span data-lake-id="u7846eeb4" id="u7846eeb4">另一种潜在有效的方法是将近似后验设定为混合模型。然而，混合模型方法会限制变分推断的可扩展性，因为在每次参数更新时，它通常需要针对每个混合成分分别计算对数似然及其梯度，这在计算上往往代价较高</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u2792a1cc" id="u2792a1cc"><strong><span data-lake-id="uf0d37bee" id="uf0d37bee">作者提出一种新的变分推断后验近似构造方法。首先回顾当前在一般有向图模型中进行推断的主流实践，即基于摊销变分推断和高效 Monte Carlo 梯度估计的方法。随后，论文主要做出如下贡献：</span></strong></p><ul list="u536678b8"><li fid="ub3db4874" data-lake-id="uf7083a2c" id="uf7083a2c"><span data-lake-id="u353ab556" id="u353ab556">提出使用归一化流来刻画近似后验分布。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u5eb51ebf" id="u5eb51ebf" style="color: #663000">归一化流是一种通过一系列可逆映射将简单概率密度变换为复杂分布的工具。基于归一化流的推断可以得到一个更紧的、经过修正的变分下界，并且新增项仅带来线性时间复杂度的计算开销</span></strong></li><li fid="ub3db4874" data-lake-id="u340aa80a" id="u340aa80a"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub9ec2e32" id="ub9ec2e32" style="color: #2A4200">表明归一化流可以扩展到无穷小流，从而定义一类在渐近情形下能够恢复真实后验分布的后验近似。这在一定程度上克服变分推断长期以来被批评的一个问题，即近似分布族过于受限，无法逼近真实后验</span></strong></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="bIunY" id="bIunY" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u5e34aca8" id="u5e34aca8">🐇</span><span data-lake-id="uc81dbbbd" id="uc81dbbbd"> 𝑨𝒎𝒐𝒓𝒕𝒊𝒛𝒆𝒅 𝑽𝒂𝒓𝒊𝒂𝒕𝒊𝒐𝒏𝒂𝒍 𝑰𝒏𝒇𝒆𝒓𝒆𝒏𝒄𝒆</span></h2><p data-lake-id="ua3ec64d1" id="ua3ec64d1"><span data-lake-id="uf7085f72" id="uf7085f72">为进行推断，通常只需要围绕概率模型的边际似然进行分析，而这要求对模型中的缺失变量或潜变量进行边缘化。然而，这一积分在实际中通常是不可解析的，因此转而优化边际似然的一个下界。考虑一个一般的概率模型，其中观测变量为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F712ecf7894348e92d8779c3ee87eeeb0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Iejva%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5dd977b5" id="u5dd977b5">，需要被积分掉的潜变量为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20z%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe88346e0623a551732d563f057199515.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zPDJT%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud86730d4" id="ud86730d4">，模型参数为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fed5a4aa5e092e303a69c608582c70db9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kkqYr%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud3cacf5f" id="ud3cacf5f">。为潜变量引入一个近似后验分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D(z%7Cx)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F84b2324e511f03390ce9fd98e23a8e8b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qEqqr%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u386d7915" id="u386d7915">，并根据变分原理得到边际似然的一个下界</span></p><p data-lake-id="ub6deaff3" id="ub6deaff3" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboxed%7B%5Cn%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%20%26%3D%20%5C%5Clog%20%5C%5Cint%20p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D)p(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D)d%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%20%5C%5Clog%20%5C%5Cint%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bq_%5C%5Cphi(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%7D%7Bq_%5C%5Cphi(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%7D%20p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D)p(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D)d%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%5C%5Cgeq%20-%5C%5Cmathbb%7BD%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BKL%7D%7D%5Bq_%5C%5Cphi(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%5C%5C%7Cp(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D)%5D%20%2B%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_q%5B%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D)%5D%20%3D%20-%5C%5Cmathcal%7BF%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%2C%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe5ecd20d11d4649fcd6b44de8891ccba.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tFmjb%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ubf7a8c55" id="ubf7a8c55"><span data-lake-id="ucc0e3bbb" id="ucc0e3bbb">其中，最后一个不等式由 Jensen 不等式得到。</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(x%7Cz)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5947100c3dcfac5fa69c958090fe8718.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DcQIX%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4754c27b" id="u4754c27b">表示似然函数，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p(z)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc61ee90bc7f60e00ed376717fbd7002c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DsD56%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u43713f8e" id="u43713f8e">表示潜变量的先验分布。上述下界通常被称为负自由能，或称为证据下界。它由两个部分组成：</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u9888575f" id="u9888575f">第一项是近似后验分布与先验分布之间的 KL 散度，可被视为一种正则化项；第二项是期望对数似然，通常对应于重构误差或数据拟合项。该下界为同时优化模型参数</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8bd6ababe28124a7755c347ae7cb0e6f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Cbfd4%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u8a59d425" id="u8a59d425">和变分近似参数</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cphi%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff547e08b7db926659f19deee4b4363d1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cqG3b%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u8a26ff2b" id="u8a26ff2b">提供一个统一的目标函数</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="ufaa659b5" id="ufaa659b5"><span data-lake-id="u2fa51b2e" id="u2fa51b2e">当前变分推断的主流实践通常使用小批量数据和随机梯度下降来优化这一目标函数。这也是变分推断能够扩展到大规模数据集和复杂概率模型的重要原因。为成功应用变分方法，需要解决两个关键问题</span></p><ul list="uac0d8c42"><li fid="u912dedc1" data-lake-id="u4ab7e18e" id="u4ab7e18e"><strong><span data-lake-id="uecc5113c" id="uecc5113c" style="color: #70000D">如何高效计算期望对数似然关于变分参数的梯度，即如何计算</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bq_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D(z)%7D%20%5C%5Cbig%5B%5C%5Clog%20p_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(x%7Cz)%5C%5Cbig%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc4802542c3332bdad1bef63a5d220c63.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vs2Fk%22%7D" style="color: #70000D"></card></li><li fid="u912dedc1" data-lake-id="u5dc12b77" id="u5dc12b77"><strong><span data-lake-id="u6717c712" id="u6717c712" style="color: #70000D">如何选择一个尽可能丰富、同时又具有计算可行性的近似后验分布族</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q(%5C%5Ccdot)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fae32902d0c1198686778d6d549800d98.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22sHd8V%22%7D" style="color: #70000D"></card></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ua0798062" id="ua0798062"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub3d8f6ca" id="ub3d8f6ca">论文重点关注的是第二个问题，即如何构造更具表达能力的近似后验分布。对于第一个问题，作者采用两类工具：</span></strong><strong><span data-lake-id="u048ced63" id="u048ced63" style="color: #2A4200">Monte Carlo 梯度估计和推断网络</span></strong><strong><span data-lake-id="uae86eb9d" id="uae86eb9d">。当二者结合使用时，便形成摊销变分推断</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u1dde1e0e" id="u1dde1e0e"><span data-lake-id="u4a78ce99" id="u4a78ce99">📌</span><span data-lake-id="u3f51f144" id="u3f51f144"> 多年来，变分推断领域的大量研究都集中在如何计算期望对数似然项关于变分参数的梯度，即如何计算</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bq_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D(z)%7D%5B%5C%5Clog%20p(x%7Cz)%5D.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fda20a560af4e38808857e30c31eeb046.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VfA7i%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uba9df838" id="uba9df838">在早期方法中，通常依赖局部变分方法来处理这一问题。然而，在当前的实践中，通常使用 Monte Carlo 近似来计算这类期望；如果变分下界中的 KL 项无法解析求解，也同样可以通过 Monte Carlo 方法进行估计。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u7175e50c" id="u7175e50c" style="color: #2A4200">由于这种估计同时包含两类随机性：一类来自小批量数据采样，另一类来自对期望项的 Monte Carlo 采样，因此这一过程被恰当地称为双重随机估计</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="uf33bfd5b" id="uf33bfd5b"><span data-lake-id="u131b8ae7" id="u131b8ae7">论文主要关注具有连续潜变量的模型。作者采用的方法是将期望项进行非中心化重参数化，并结合 Monte Carlo 近似来计算所需梯度。这种方法被称为随机反向传播，也常被称为随机梯度变分贝叶斯，或仿射变分推断。随机反向传播主要包含两个步骤</span></p><ul list="u0e57e1ee"><li fid="ud7d23b48" data-lake-id="ue0ba5269" id="ue0ba5269"><span data-lake-id="u1495e85f" id="u1495e85f">第一步是</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ud7335629" id="ud7335629">重参数化</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u524b909c" id="u524b909c">。也就是说，将潜变量重新表示为一个已知基础分布中的随机变量与一个可微变换的组合。这类可微变换可以是位置—尺度变换，也可以是累积分布函数变换。以高斯近似后验为例，若</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D(z)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F67a49334fcc25e6d923abea275dd1bb8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22KBYyp%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3c76635e" id="u3c76635e">是均值为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Cmu%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc4a7a372588438938925e0d02f894206.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22RXBVh%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u926ddfe0" id="u926ddfe0">、方差为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma%5E2%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F217d731c58118430ccbb4f9f6d44ce08.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22j1WoQ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uade8e027" id="uade8e027">的高斯分布，其中变分参数为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cphi%3D%5C%5C%7B%5C%5Cmu%2C%5C%5Csigma%5E2%5C%5C%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0763469f73561ed550d863ff57b96236.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lSprY%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6c2dd50b" id="u6c2dd50b">，则可以利用标准正态分布作为基础分布，将潜变量重写。随机性不再直接来自依赖参数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cphi%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff547e08b7db926659f19deee4b4363d1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TY5jZ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u839ea2e7" id="u839ea2e7">的分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D(z)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F67a49334fcc25e6d923abea275dd1bb8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Pl2Yv%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8db6d07d" id="u8db6d07d">，而是来自一个固定的、与参数无关的基础噪声分布。潜变量</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20z%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe88346e0623a551732d563f057199515.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DrOOq%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u89053720" id="u89053720">则通过一个关于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Cphi%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5dba4edae255496d9a3c95cc23c3237b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22pr1Ht%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u156d5f5b" id="u156d5f5b">可微的确定性变换得到</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ucacaeda0" id="ucacaeda0" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(z%7C%5C%5Cmu%2C%5C%5Csigma%5E2)%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5CLongleftrightarrow%20%5C%5Cquad%20z%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmu%20%2B%20%5C%5Csigma%20%5C%5Cepsilon%2C%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Cepsilon%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(0%2C1)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1f6a5a177489315aa6303842082dae65.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22L83bB%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u79fa6471"><li fid="u551cea5c" data-lake-id="u423b366b" id="u423b366b"><span data-lake-id="u884f1203" id="u884f1203">第二步是</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u1fccc0b1" id="u1fccc0b1">基于 Monte Carlo 的反向传播</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u8fda586e" id="u8fda586e">。在完成重参数化之后，就可以从基础分布中采样，并使用 Monte Carlo 近似来估计期望。同时，由于采样后的变量可以表示为参数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cphi%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa22f9b1191699175522916b213018232.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Hr0sy%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc99232d2" id="uc99232d2">的可微函数，因此可以直接通过反向传播计算目标函数关于变分参数的梯度。也就是说，原本较难处理的梯度</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bq_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D(z)%7D%5Bf_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(z)%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8e1bc888879ca07be06450291efe81bd.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xxVaV%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5e64d53f" id="u5e64d53f">可以转化为在标准正态噪声下对如下形式进行估计</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(0%2C1)%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7Df_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(%5C%5Cmu%2B%5C%5Csigma%5C%5Cepsilon)%20%5C%5Cright%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F09f0f94c94dfa78ec164a34a3013d553.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XG3Lw%22%7D"></card></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ued96bc3c" id="ued96bc3c"><span data-lake-id="ubd640752" id="ubd640752">除随机反向传播之外，还有一类基于 Monte Carlo 控制变量估计器的通用方法，也可以用于计算梯度。这类方法可以处理连续潜变量，也可以处理离散潜变量，因此适用范围更广。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u1fb2103b" id="u1fb2103b">然而，对于连续潜变量模型而言，随机反向传播的一个重要优势在于：相比其他竞争性梯度估计器，它通常具有最低的方差</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="ue789cfba" id="ue789cfba"><span data-lake-id="u2bfa7f6b" id="u2bfa7f6b">📌</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u8af2a486" id="u8af2a486"> 第二项重要实践是，近似后验分布</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D(%5C%5Ccdot)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbac343d30cfe5fb17ba795fe11b07f0a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LjJLG%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ua8964692" id="ua8964692">通常通过识别模型或推断网络来表示</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u77985a9f" id="u77985a9f">。所谓推断网络，是指一种学习从观测变量到潜在变量之逆向映射的模型。借助推断网络，无需为每一个数据点单独计算一组变分参数，而是可以学习一组全局变分参数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cphi%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff547e08b7db926659f19deee4b4363d1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22eBhaj%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u780b8993" id="u780b8993">，使其在训练阶段和测试阶段均可用于推断。这样一来，推断成本便可以通过推断网络参数在不同潜在变量后验估计之间的泛化能力而得到摊销。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u98bde8d1" id="u98bde8d1">最简单的一类推断模型是对角高斯分布：</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u6726b714" id="u6726b714" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D(z%7Cx)%3D%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D%5C%5Cbigl(z%7C%5C%5Cmu_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D(x)%2C%20%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bdiag%7D(%5C%5Csigma_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D%5E%7B2%7D(x))%5C%5Cbigr)%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa58b81a24c2e3df18503ec32394f08ce.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xppG8%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ue63f2f90"><li fid="u3664bfa8" data-lake-id="uc1bf86b5" id="uc1bf86b5"><span data-lake-id="u775e5a21" id="u775e5a21">其中，均值函数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmu_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D(x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe553b1b236c3b502871bd30deea9332b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22feahp%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5702ac1d" id="u5702ac1d">与标准差函数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D(x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F844796ce1f150e98d943166eff307cb8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ey4cM%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u974ff785" id="u974ff785">均由深度神经网络进行参数化</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="udb6496a1" id="udb6496a1"><span data-lake-id="ub96d4445" id="ub96d4445">📌</span><span data-lake-id="u480f91e7" id="u480f91e7"> </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u034364ae" id="u034364ae">DLGM 是一类通用的深层有向图模型，由</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20L%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F97a65d824ef5766184877c3f711d3e69.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mfgOn%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uf0ba2969" id="uf0ba2969">层高斯潜在变量构成，其中第</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20l%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2086b3e9a86ae9cf4579cb1fa00957f2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22q6QjA%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ue5ebecd3" id="ue5ebecd3">层的潜在变量记为</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z_l%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F21bddec7172be42d80f91fe59719c739.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22imqdY%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u42a7d80a" id="u42a7d80a">。每一层潜在变量都以非线性方式依赖于其上一层变量；在 DLGM 中，这种非线性依赖关系由深度神经网络进行建模。其联合概率模型可表示为：</span></p><p data-lake-id="udd65cbdc" id="udd65cbdc" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p(x%2Cz_1%2C%5C%5Cldots%2Cz_L)%20%3D%20p(x%7Cf_0(z_1))%20%5C%5Cprod_%7Bl%3D1%7D%5E%7BL%7D%20p(z_l%7Cf_l(z_%7Bl%2B1%7D)).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8f7e470c3e13ad5c739fb16bf36ffacf.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Xq8EW%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u723c336a"><li fid="u780fd0d9" data-lake-id="u0950c600" id="u0950c600"><strong><span data-lake-id="uaa50a171" id="uaa50a171" style="color: #AE146E">其中，第</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc895173d3be4872abf206be4268a58cb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Wf7XQ%22%7D" style="color: #AE146E"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u47d18cbe" id="u47d18cbe" style="color: #AE146E">层的高斯分布不再依赖于其他随机变量。潜在变量先验分布通常设定为单位高斯分布</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p(z_l)%3D%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(0%2CI)%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb7f0d113c05e65eb84118a82e02aa5bc.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rnwzn%22%7D" style="color: #AE146E"></card><span data-lake-id="uc390be8b" id="uc390be8b">而观测似然</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(x%7Cz)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5947100c3dcfac5fa69c958090fe8718.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kmfwv%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2af3b966" id="u2af3b966">则可以根据具体数据类型选择适当的分布形式。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uf46dee80" id="uf46dee80" style="color: #663000">该似然分布以第一层潜在变量</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20z_1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7987ad3d8f862297ebef553fe7a745e2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22i6uVH%22%7D" style="color: #663000"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u5f82abf3" id="u5f82abf3" style="color: #663000">为条件，并同样由深度神经网络进行参数化</span></strong><span data-lake-id="udabb4994" id="udabb4994">。DLGM 使用连续潜在变量，因此非常适合结合变分下界与随机反向传播方法进行高效的摊销变分推断</span></li><li fid="u780fd0d9" data-lake-id="u3c7b894a" id="u3c7b894a"><span data-lake-id="ufbbabc7d" id="ufbbabc7d">从整体上看，DLGM 与推断网络组成的端到端系统可以被理解为一种编码器—解码器架构。Kingma 与 Welling 正是从这一视角出发，将生成模型与推断策略的结合形式称为变分自编码器。Kingma 与 Welling 以及 Rezende 等工作中所采用的推断网络，通常是较为简单的对角高斯分布，或对角加低秩结构的高斯分布</span></li><li fid="u780fd0d9" data-lake-id="ud72ab084" id="ud72ab084"><span data-lake-id="ubee1f4d3" id="ubee1f4d3">然而，真实的后验分布往往比这类假设所能表达的分布更加复杂。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u3c9426b7" id="u3c9426b7" style="color: #DF2A3F">因此，如何以可扩展的方式定义多模态的、受约束的后验近似分布，仍然是变分推断领域中的一个重要开放问题</span></strong></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="njHJe" id="njHJe" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u364aedae" id="u364aedae">🦨</span><span data-lake-id="uacb40dbe" id="uacb40dbe" style="color: #000000"> 𝑵𝒐𝒓𝒎𝒂𝒍𝒊𝒛𝒊𝒏𝒈 𝑭𝒍𝒐𝒘𝒔</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u5d4f656c" id="u5d4f656c"><span data-lake-id="u446e8eaa" id="u446e8eaa">通过考察变分下界可以看出，使得</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BKL%7D%7D%5C%5Cbigl%5Bq_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D(z%7Cx)%5C%5C%7Cp_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(z%7Cx)%5C%5Cbigr%5D%3D0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2dfcb8d34ee7297a4f327cb43b6c14ed.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qMBrZ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7f5bfef9" id="u7f5bfef9">成立的最优变分分布，应当满足</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D(z%7Cx)%3Dp_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(z%7Cx)%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbb23ef9c8393385c79c04877363ffb99.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VzqSa%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9f4c3ba9" id="u9f4c3ba9">也就是说，近似后验分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D(z%7Cx)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F84b2324e511f03390ce9fd98e23a8e8b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22NF9Sp%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u52823791" id="u52823791">必须与真实后验分布完全一致</span></p><ul list="u207100e6"><li fid="u5922512a" data-lake-id="ua020c7ef" id="ua020c7ef"><span data-lake-id="ud30adcbc" id="ud30adcbc">在通常采用的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q(%5C%5Ccdot)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fae32902d0c1198686778d6d549800d98.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22m4E2M%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3c848f96" id="u3c848f96">分布族下，例如独立高斯分布或其他均值场近似，这一目标显然难以实现。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u57cbe1f7" id="u57cbe1f7" style="color: #663000">变分方法的一个重要局限就在于：由于可选近似分布族的表达能力有限，即使在渐近情形下也未必能够得到真实后验分布</span></strong></li><li fid="u5922512a" data-lake-id="ubfa6c323" id="ubfa6c323"><span data-lake-id="u9135db0e" id="u9135db0e">理想的变分分布族</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D(z%7Cx)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F84b2324e511f03390ce9fd98e23a8e8b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VTZMZ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9bed916f" id="u9bed916f">应当具有高度灵活的表达能力，最好能够足够灵活，以至于真实后验分布本身也包含在该分布族之中。通向这一理想目标的一条路径，便是基于</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u2d998d89" id="u2d998d89">归一化流</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u23e8b885" id="u23e8b885">的思想</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u2c71e2f1" id="u2c71e2f1"><strong><span data-lake-id="uea7c8ba1" id="uea7c8ba1" style="color: #004347">归一化流描述的是：一个概率密度如何通过一系列可逆映射逐步变换。通过反复应用变量变换公式，初始概率密度会沿着这一系列可逆映射不断流动。在该序列的终点，我们仍然得到一个合法的概率分布，因此这种流被称为归一化流</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u8220da9c" id="u8220da9c"><strong><span data-lake-id="u13b5341f" id="u13b5341f">有限流（Finite Flows）：密度变换的基本规则考虑一个可逆且光滑的映射</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f%3A%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5Ed%20%5C%5Cto%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5Ed%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2080df8a2c3bfd76e4ca005b6eeb025e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22FF5bD%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u35ba9105" id="u35ba9105">，其逆映射记为</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f%5E%7B-1%7D%3Dg%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa39643ff588b1e97141b2f4546320a61.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22iiNX3%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u90043995" id="u90043995">，即满足复合关系</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22g%20%5C%5Ccirc%20f(z)%3Dz%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F10149983b504d180bb6f283bde60ff42.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22o9J5V%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uc2388e4b" id="uc2388e4b">。若使用该映射对服从分布</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q(z)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0eaa0f59f74c2e7a454981adb98e7812.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22a6jNb%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u4c26d3fc" id="u4c26d3fc">的随机变量</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20z%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe88346e0623a551732d563f057199515.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QEm8o%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u3fa15db8" id="u3fa15db8">进行变换，则所得随机变量</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z'%20%3D%20f(z)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9220871bc8d9ed9db291017871297ec7.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DGgkA%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u4c7123b4" id="u4c7123b4">的分布为：</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="ue894c36c" id="ue894c36c" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboxed%7B%5Cnq(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D')%20%3D%20q(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D)%20%5C%5Cleft%7C%20%5C%5Cdet%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20f%5E%7B-1%7D%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D'%7D%20%5C%5Cright%7C%20%3D%20q(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D)%20%5C%5Cleft%7C%20%5C%5Cdet%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20f%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cright%7C%5E%7B-1%7D%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F716d594659fe2ec19c587ed0dd092050.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LkWjs%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u95a0f7c2" id="u95a0f7c2"><span data-lake-id="u7ae939f0" id="u7ae939f0">其中，最后一个等式可由链式法则，即反函数定理推出，并且是可逆函数雅可比矩阵的一项基本性质。通过组合多个简单映射，并反复应用上述变量替换规则，可以构造出任意复杂的概率密度。设初始随机变量</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7d975eb112252fb8cc06982e37929e50.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22El5Sx%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4be15a7d" id="u4be15a7d">服从分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F62ff4015bf1908d1ce2f6ea464d2018a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rtwXy%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf2a6e921" id="uf2a6e921">，并依次经过</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20K%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2a44da316da48b0ab8fd154f1f9108c8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ErWcP%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u404ad705" id="u404ad705">个变换</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f_k%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F25abb1c585b24591b78e8864aad7dd6a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22e7CMN%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u30eca64c" id="u30eca64c">，则经过连续变换后得到的密度</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_K(z_K)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F40644f9ab2b3a5be5309e3f1369c9859.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22v7atR%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u015d88ca" id="u015d88ca">可表示为</span></p><p data-lake-id="u12eb0cb2" id="u12eb0cb2" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboxed%7B%5Cn%5C%5Cbegin%7Bgathered%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D_K%20%3D%20f_K%20%5C%5Ccirc%20%5C%5Cdots%20%5C%5Ccirc%20f_2%20%5C%5Ccirc%20f_1(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D_0)%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cln%20q_K(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D_K)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cln%20q_0(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D_0)%20-%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bk%3D1%7D%5EK%20%5C%5Cln%20%5C%5Cdet%20%5C%5Cleft%7C%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20f_k%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D_%7Bk-1%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cright%7C%2C%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Bgathered%7D%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd6aaf5e451baae08a8203a8be14d0cd9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22b3umL%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="uac2e7140" id="uac2e7140"><strong><span data-lake-id="u7f8a6918" id="u7f8a6918" style="color: #2A4200">由随机变量序列</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z_k%20%3D%20f_k(z_%7Bk-1%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fccd8eca47200803abe82def4d68185f6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ipBb2%22%7D" style="color: #2A4200"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ucdbf95d3" id="ucdbf95d3" style="color: #2A4200">所形成的轨迹称为流；由相应分布序列</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_k%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F91b8b5062b08ea035527fb9a3a9f6eec.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Shh6G%22%7D" style="color: #2A4200"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uf56a7c30" id="uf56a7c30" style="color: #2A4200">所形成的演化路径，则称为归一化流。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u7aee882a" id="u7aee882a">这类变换具有一个重要性质，通常被称为</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ub1b3b19d" id="ub1b3b19d" style="color: #DF2A3F">无意识统计学家定律（LOTUS）</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u1b6b867d" id="u1b6b867d">：关于变换后密度</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_K%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8285fde1829846266744c0dcd54a7733.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Jz6S1%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1d47e28d" id="u1d47e28d">的期望，可在不显式求得</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_K%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8285fde1829846266744c0dcd54a7733.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jQGRH%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u51b9fb0a" id="u51b9fb0a">的情况下计算。对于任意函数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22h(z)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8bfc4f2800bb4231946fe6d58e8a9930.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DirKA%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8fb228c6" id="u8fb228c6">​</span></p><p data-lake-id="udcc5e95e" id="udcc5e95e" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboxed%7B%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bq_K%7D%5Bh(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D)%5D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bq_0%7D%5Bh(f_K%20%5C%5Ccirc%20f_%7BK-1%7D%20%5C%5Ccirc%20%5C%5Cdots%20%5C%5Ccirc%20f_1(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D_0))%5D%2C%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F371a7b34177a8ab34081e3e3dc1d3be7.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22upUdu%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ua8e13424" id="ua8e13424"><strong><span data-lake-id="u3f8c6ca5" id="u3f8c6ca5">可以将可逆流的作用理解为对初始密度进行一系列局部扩张或收缩</span></strong></p><ul list="ua39233e7"><li fid="u686f4e89" data-lake-id="u91bca2c5" id="u91bca2c5"><span data-lake-id="u59544883" id="u59544883">对于扩张变换，映射</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z'%3Df(z)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3d0127830d4a852161d353abeb6f2be5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Jo7sl%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u263a1632" id="u263a1632">会将点从</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5Ed%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F088e88426d1c834283e0dfc6763110a4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22x6xpn%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u707553fb" id="u707553fb">中某一区域向外拉伸，从而降低该区域内的概率密度，同时提高区域外部的概率密度</span></li><li fid="u686f4e89" data-lake-id="uec8292ba" id="uec8292ba"><span data-lake-id="uc41d8ba3" id="uc41d8ba3">对于收缩变换，映射会将点推向某一区域的内部，从而增加该区域内部的概率密度，并降低其外部的概率密度</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u074b4d48" id="u074b4d48"><strong><span data-lake-id="ua241eab1" id="ua241eab1" style="color: #70000D">归一化流的形式化框架由此为变分推断中所需近似后验分布</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q(z%7Cx)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F190045f0903f318f55f61ec36245902b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ReosX%22%7D" style="color: #70000D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ua942d27d" id="ua942d27d" style="color: #70000D">提供一种系统性的构造方式。通过适当地选择一系列变换</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f_K%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5291148680b6bd9404734a7f306c8b92.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lUVOC%22%7D" style="color: #70000D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u9416f6f1" id="u9416f6f1" style="color: #70000D">，可以从简单的因子化分布出发，例如独立高斯分布，并施加不同长度的归一化流，从而得到复杂程度逐渐提升、甚至具有多模态结构的分布</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u9570be46" id="u9570be46"><strong><span data-lake-id="u7cf303d1" id="u7cf303d1">无穷小流（Infinitesimal Flows）：归一化流的长度趋于无穷。在这种情况下得到的是一种无穷小流。它不再由有限个变换组成的序列来描述；相反被表述为一个偏微分方程，用于刻画初始密度</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_0(z)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F298f0d8bfa16d045f37f7b7732fcc0c0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YIv1D%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ue048ff35" id="ue048ff35"> 如何随时间演化，算子</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22T%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1553dae3cc5c15cddb4f5b5a367b0aba.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22RIbE5%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u57db2dca" id="u57db2dca">描述连续时间下的动力学过程：</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u9d39d391" id="u9d39d391" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20t%7D%20q_t(z)%20%3D%20T_t%5Bq_t(z)%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdc9c7bfe2ed288d7cec800856e235c1b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22SKfz4%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u2042aeb5" id="u2042aeb5"><strong><span data-lake-id="ufa552023" id="ufa552023" style="color: #101E60">Langevin 流：一类重要的流由 Langevin 随机微分方程（stochastic differential equation, SDE）给出：</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="ub7405b6b" id="ub7405b6b" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22dz(t)%20%3D%20F(z(t)%2Ct)dt%20%2B%20G(z(t)%2Ct)d%5C%5Cxi(t)%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1dea2f0672ececf1f7bbe017d8c4503b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22grsuH%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u548a2a03"><li fid="u48ae86f5" data-lake-id="ub72f7d62" id="ub72f7d62"><span data-lake-id="u3908fba1" id="u3908fba1">其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22d%5C%5Cxi(t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fef6a6055f6601e7bee4de2bf37ebe4ac.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uO5bq%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u05becc62" id="u05becc62">表示 Wiener 过程，满足</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D%5B%5C%5Cxi_i(t)%5D%20%3D%200%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F95032cf7a26e82f27069453d2ebb9d51.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22stGhq%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf3d5cfbd" id="uf3d5cfbd">并且</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D%5B%5C%5Cxi_i(t)%5C%5Cxi_j(t')%5D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cdelta_%7Bij%7D%5C%5Cdelta(t-t').%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F89687ae1f2364575a2b99e2b27735282.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22V7rSD%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3227fa40" id="u3227fa40">这里</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22F%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7aaf2781990aa336d909f7ebd32e2f69.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ARdKo%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u93bef161" id="u93bef161">是漂移向量，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22D%20%3D%20GG%5E%5C%5Ctop%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5ace2af6c5b4f7254fdd75ca1dc01bc8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UtE22%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9880f964" id="u9880f964">是扩散矩阵。若将一个初始密度为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_0(z)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F298f0d8bfa16d045f37f7b7732fcc0c0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22SfMny%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u71a2cd15" id="u71a2cd15">的随机变量</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20z%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe88346e0623a551732d563f057199515.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22S2Epu%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u70690b00" id="u70690b00">通过 Langevin 流进行变换，则密度的变换规律由 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u50f6e316" id="u50f6e316">Fokker–Planck 方程</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uf7a8131f" id="uf7a8131f"> 给出；在概率论中，它也被称为 Kolmogorov 方程。经过变换后，时刻</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd99979941e2b40b5ffd75f89c83e37b4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22S3uIk%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua1da6fc3" id="ua1da6fc3">的样本密度</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_t(z)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb2fd16acb3f05a1feb3facb3162e0778.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AwArr%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue66d65d3" id="ue66d65d3">将按照如下方程演化：</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ud258de56" id="ud258de56" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20t%7Dq_t(z)%20%3D%20-%5C%5Csum_i%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20z_i%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20F_i(z%2Ct)q_t%20%5C%5Cright%5D%20%2B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B2%7D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%2Cj%7D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%5E2%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20z_i%20%5C%5Cpartial%20z_j%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20D_%7Bij%7D(z%2Ct)q_t%20%5C%5Cright%5D.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F18ee6e7be0e84dbeb776533276227254.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22pv64m%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u50983776"><li fid="ud8b5e797" data-lake-id="u77576235" id="u77576235"><span data-lake-id="ua37b6d31" id="ua37b6d31">在机器学习中，最常使用的一种 Langevin 流形式为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22F(z%2Ct)%20%3D%20-%5C%5Cnabla_z%20L(z)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F92c3f2da7fbc720409139a1ccf04dea2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ytZsD%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8908c47d" id="u8908c47d">以及</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22G(z%2Ct)%3D%5C%5Csqrt%7B2%7DI%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F085a005bc948d9943d0af01d3f93f7ff.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22felsa%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u82c7c70c" id="u82c7c70c">其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L(z)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F41c0ce5b3e4400c53bf9a0ed3877b3f4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lj6aD%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ueddc7f21" id="ueddc7f21">是模型的未归一化对数密度，或者可以理解为与能量函数相关的目标函数。在这种设定下，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_t(z)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb2fd16acb3f05a1feb3facb3162e0778.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DQqSp%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1461ec65" id="u1461ec65">的平稳解由 Boltzmann 分布给出：</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_%5C%5Cinfty(z)%20%5C%5Cpropto%20e%5E%7B-L(z)%7D.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb6825a80f81841e82ec8de7157d7dd17.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MjTy7%22%7D"></card></li><li fid="ud8b5e797" data-lake-id="u68a98c81" id="u68a98c81"><span data-lake-id="u0ad12796" id="u0ad12796">也就是说，如果从某一初始密度</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_0(z)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F298f0d8bfa16d045f37f7b7732fcc0c0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22EC9Wu%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3d968938" id="u3d968938">出发，并让其中的样本</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7d975eb112252fb8cc06982e37929e50.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WnGWA%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3aefaa54" id="u3aefaa54">按照 Langevin 随机微分方程不断演化，那么最终得到的点</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z_%5C%5Cinfty%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F04ba48b27468dfda53f8a9d0101a490a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22umgeF%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uad443d97" id="uad443d97">将服从如下分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_%5C%5Cinfty(z)%20%5C%5Cpropto%20e%5E%7B-L(z)%7D.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb6825a80f81841e82ec8de7157d7dd17.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xNTuD%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u918676cb" id="u918676cb">在理想条件下，这一极限分布可以对应于真实后验分布。因此，Langevin 流为从复杂密度中进行采样提供一种重要途径</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u37fe692c" id="u37fe692c"><strong><span data-lake-id="u0de83abd" id="u0de83abd" style="color: #5C0036">Hamiltonian 流：Hamiltonian Monte Carlo，简称 HMC，也可以从归一化流的角度加以描述</span></strong></p><ul list="ub03fad02"><li fid="ud46ecc83" data-lake-id="uf4264ef7" id="uf4264ef7"><span data-lake-id="u209e949e" id="u209e949e">具体而言，它可以被看作是在一个扩展空间上的归一化流。该扩展空间记为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctilde%7Bz%7D%20%3D%20(z%2C%5C%5Comega)%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2155ae89cdf86de51a34a2176e5316f9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hbEfp%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2a25162c" id="u2a25162c">其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F02bab26178a0cd05dae15ad487830237.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22aJKQa%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7573cf2a" id="u7573cf2a">是原始变量，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Comega%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F327cab7c761f03df97ad9c71506d0589.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22KKSuo%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc7c6b1df" id="uc7c6b1df">通常表示辅助动量变量。其动力学由 Hamiltonian 函数决定，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22M%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6f5dde593f0bc27956e14b5eaec2ed17.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kIxRd%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc838e3eb" id="uc838e3eb">通常表示质量矩阵：</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uea94d330" id="uea94d330" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22H(z%2C%5C%5Comega)%20%3D%20-L(z)%20%2B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B2%7D%5C%5Comega%5E%5C%5Ctop%20M%20%5C%5Comega.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff61169363e8403cc5587e65b565c621c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BPfxV%22%7D"></card></p><h2 data-lake-id="WRjcF" id="WRjcF" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u0b96a7a9" id="u0b96a7a9">🦫</span><span data-lake-id="udbd8f4a8" id="udbd8f4a8"> 𝑰𝒏𝒇𝒆𝒓𝒆𝒏𝒄𝒆 𝒘𝒊𝒕𝒉 𝑵𝒐𝒓𝒎𝒂𝒍𝒊𝒛𝒊𝒏𝒈 𝑭𝒍𝒐𝒘𝒔</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u7a7cdbab" id="u7a7cdbab"><strong><span data-lake-id="u0fbe0ef0" id="u0fbe0ef0">为能够使用有限归一化流进行可扩展的推断，必须指定一类可逆变换，并且需要一种能够高效计算雅可比行列式的机制</span></strong></p><ul list="u1a0a517e"><li fid="u209dbf68" data-lake-id="u3909c80f" id="u3909c80f"><span data-lake-id="uc1d7f52d" id="uc1d7f52d">虽然构造可逆的参数化函数是相对直接的，例如使用可逆神经网络，但这类方法在计算雅可比行列式时通常具有较高复杂度。其复杂度通常随</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22O(LD%5E3)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fda86dd020471532387eac8c728ec0e4d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22V91AJ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua0aa8b19" id="ua0aa8b19">增长，其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F558270b7f0a90c3c286b860273d106a0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ojtWx%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ufc33bc29" id="ufc33bc29">表示隐藏层的维度，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc895173d3be4872abf206be4268a58cb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22J6lrE%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf8ceec5e" id="uf8ceec5e">表示所使用的隐藏层数量</span></li><li fid="u209dbf68" data-lake-id="ud349834c" id="ud349834c"><span data-lake-id="u66230336" id="u66230336">计算雅可比行列式的梯度还需要若干额外操作，这些操作同样具有</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22O(LD%5E3)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fda86dd020471532387eac8c728ec0e4d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jgHj1%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua961b0bb" id="ua961b0bb">的复杂度，并且往往涉及矩阵求逆，而矩阵求逆在数值上可能是不稳定的。因此需要设计这样一类归一化流：</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ufa5caafc" id="ufa5caafc" style="color: #DF2A3F">它们要么能够以较低代价计算行列式，要么根本不需要显式计算雅可比矩阵</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u63e6fedd" id="u63e6fedd"><strong><span data-lake-id="u64b10389" id="u64b10389">考虑如下形式的一族变换</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f(z)%3Dz%2Bu%20h(w%5E%5C%5Ctop%20z%2Bb)%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F82bda056c3eebcf7eebe312b30b95c2d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ehfMU%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ub80a30ec" id="ub80a30ec">其中</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clambda%3D%5C%5C%7Bw%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5ED%2C%5C%5C%20u%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5ED%2C%5C%5C%20b%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5C%5C%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3a25602d938e1be848c0dea0d1032ad0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22pK8xH%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ub0a6c20e" id="ub0a6c20e">是自由参数，</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22h(%5C%5Ccdot)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe5827c17bafdeffd11eade6996dd052f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22nTRxu%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u95703571" id="u95703571">是一个光滑的逐元素非线性函数。对于该映射，可以利用矩阵行列式引理，在</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22O(D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F558b5ba0caf369d997575ddaa069243c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22NLVNz%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ucdad248d" id="ucdad248d">时间内计算对数雅可比行列式项。定义</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u2b9bdc5e" id="u2b9bdc5e" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboxed%7B%5Cn%5C%5Cbegin%7Bgathered%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cpsi(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D)%20%3D%20h'(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D%20%2B%20b)%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%7C%20%5C%5Cdet%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20f%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cright%7C%20%3D%20%7C%5C%5Cdet(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D%20%2B%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bu%7D%5C%5Cpsi(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D)%5E%5C%5Ctop)%7C%20%3D%20%7C1%20%2B%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bu%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%20%5C%5Cpsi(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D)%7C.%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Bgathered%7D%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9459ad29bea12ee00c98474a0110bc44.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TGN1j%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u3a2cb5ba"><li fid="u5f756037" data-lake-id="u9430a51f" id="u9430a51f"><span data-lake-id="ua690979a" id="ua690979a">若将任意初始密度</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_0(z)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F298f0d8bfa16d045f37f7b7732fcc0c0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22K708a%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u12be3d23" id="u12be3d23">依次通过一系列形如映射</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20f_k%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fabb7d0969c83326924f3632027362eb4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wc6BH%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc49e3f11" id="uc49e3f11">进行变换，则所得密度</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_K(z_K)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F40644f9ab2b3a5be5309e3f1369c9859.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zzI0V%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9a610c0c" id="u9a610c0c">可以隐式表示为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uefd7f82a" id="uefd7f82a" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboxed%7B%5Cn%5C%5Cbegin%7Bgathered%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D_K%20%3D%20f_K%20%5C%5Ccirc%20f_%7BK-1%7D%20%5C%5Ccirc%20%5C%5Cdots%20%5C%5Ccirc%20f_1(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D)%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cln%20q_K(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D_K)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cln%20q_0(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D)%20-%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bk%3D1%7D%5EK%20%5C%5Cln%20%7C1%20%2B%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bu%7D_k%5E%5C%5Ctop%20%5C%5Cpsi_k(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D_k)%7C.%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Bgathered%7D%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F580a563c66cdf470cd5a4135e720d551.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22FgTqK%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u4d2e8823"><li fid="u96b5e5c1" data-lake-id="u452f4816" id="u452f4816"><strong><span data-lake-id="uf5b6f7a1" id="uf5b6f7a1" style="color: #2A4200">由此所定义的流，通过沿着与超平面</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22w%5E%5C%5Ctop%20z%2Bb%3D0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F62fa72f194bc7d2678d48067b2182255.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ylAgZ%22%7D" style="color: #2A4200"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u6ffb22c2" id="u6ffb22c2" style="color: #2A4200">垂直的方向施加一系列收缩与扩张，来改变初始密度</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F62ff4015bf1908d1ce2f6ea464d2018a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mTuRO%22%7D" style="color: #2A4200"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u49cd7f05" id="u49cd7f05" style="color: #2A4200">。因此，这类映射被称为平面流（planar flows）</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uce977111" id="uce977111"><strong><span data-lake-id="u0b9c1af0" id="u0b9c1af0">作为另一种选择，还可以考虑这样一族变换：它们围绕某一参考点</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7d975eb112252fb8cc06982e37929e50.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bGj6m%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ua8a1f4ef" id="ua8a1f4ef">对初始密度</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F62ff4015bf1908d1ce2f6ea464d2018a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22aH2qA%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u6eaebc80" id="u6eaebc80">进行局部修改。该变换族定义为：</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u2f8f5b73" id="u2f8f5b73" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboxed%7B%5Cn%5C%5Cbegin%7Bgathered%7D%5Cnf(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D%20%2B%20%5C%5Cbeta%20h(%5C%5Calpha%2C%20r)(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D%20-%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D_0)%2C%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cdet%20%5C%5Cleft%7C%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20f%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cright%7C%20%3D%20%5B1%20%2B%20%5C%5Cbeta%20h(%5C%5Calpha%2C%20r)%5D%5E%7Bd-1%7D%20%5B1%20%2B%20%5C%5Cbeta%20h(%5C%5Calpha%2C%20r)%20%2B%20h'(%5C%5Calpha%2C%20r)r%5D%2C%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Ctext%7Bwhere%20%7D%20r%20%3D%20%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D%20-%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D_0%7C%2C%20%5C%5C%3B%20h(%5C%5Calpha%2C%20r)%20%3D%201%2F(%5C%5Calpha%20%2B%20r)%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Bgathered%7D%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa528f8dccc26c8ba98f62f3ef6d9f882.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22y4p1m%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ufd03886a"><li fid="uc6f9f6b7" data-lake-id="u4ec8cf02" id="u4ec8cf02"><span data-lake-id="ud5760bec" id="ud5760bec">该映射的参数为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clambda%3D%5C%5C%7Bz_0%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5ED%2C%5C%5C%20%5C%5Calpha%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%2C%5C%5C%20%5C%5Cbeta%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5C%5C%7D.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F868e62570c97cf673e3cff316569ee68.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wSiMm%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uf642515b" id="uf642515b" style="color: #004347">这一变换族同样允许以线性时间计算行列式。它围绕参考点</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20z_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8eedf9940d5d01689a2578098ee7d801.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22a9q2V%22%7D" style="color: #004347"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u653901bb" id="u653901bb" style="color: #004347">施加径向的收缩与扩张，因此被称为径向流（radial flows）</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ue42bca8a" id="ue42bca8a"><strong><span data-lake-id="u47674943" id="u47674943" style="color: #663000">使用平面流以及径向流对均匀初始密度和高斯初始密度进行扩张与收缩的效果。该可视化结果表明，通过连续施加两个变换，可以将一个球形高斯分布变换为一个双峰分布</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u19d23dc8" id="u19d23dc8" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1777258042255-57859ab4-ae45-40f7-a637-0d4235309d73.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u3186091a-1f28-4c14-835d-8daf0622073%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u6b9c8d80-0693-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A774.6364135742188%2C%22height%22%3A252%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A484345%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1419%2C%22originHeight%22%3A462%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.375%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A24%2C%22y%22%3A69%2C%22width%22%3A23%2C%22height%22%3A164%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A26%2C%22y%22%3A286%2C%22width%22%3A21%2C%22height%22%3A113%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RADIA%22%2C%22x%22%3A1070%2C%22y%22%3A8%2C%22width%22%3A72%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22K%3D10%22%2C%22x%22%3A1259%2C%22y%22%3A34%2C%22width%22%3A73%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22K%3D10%22%2C%22x%22%3A690%2C%22y%22%3A35%2C%22width%22%3A68%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PLANA%22%2C%22x%22%3A497%2C%22y%22%3A9%2C%22width%22%3A68%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22K(%3D2%22%2C%22x%22%3A501%2C%22y%22%3A36%2C%22width%22%3A60%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22K(%3D2%22%2C%22x%22%3A1078%2C%22y%22%3A36%2C%22width%22%3A65%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22K%3D1%22%2C%22x%22%3A888%2C%22y%22%3A35%2C%22width%22%3A55%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2240%22%2C%22x%22%3A125%2C%22y%22%3A32%2C%22width%22%3A44%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22K%3D1%22%2C%22x%22%3A315%2C%22y%22%3A34%2C%22width%22%3A50%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f8f2a4%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ubf0c89fe%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u7b9ff2c4" id="u7b9ff2c4"><strong><span data-lake-id="u3d056a64" id="u3d056a64">基于流的自由能界：若使用长度为</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22K%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F38a3f4d664b7a723d138f9d57be0c783.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22EdLPc%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u7f7550dd" id="u7f7550dd">的归一化流来参数化近似后验分布，即</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_%5C%5Cphi(z%7Cx)%3A%3Dq_K(z_K)%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F08d2450e0a692fdb5015813ad187e781.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XU3wH%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ub1c49536" id="ub1c49536">则自由能写成关于初始分布</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_0(z_0)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa2d069087492ca68d2ee5bc75e170a5a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22adJEZ%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u97b6418a" id="u97b6418a"> 的期望</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u3023ce44" id="u3023ce44" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboxed%7B%5Cn%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathcal%7BF%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%20%26%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bq_%5C%5Cphi(z%7Cx)%7D%5B%5C%5Clog%20q_%5C%5Cphi(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%20-%20%5C%5Clog%20p(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D)%5D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bq_0(z_0)%7D%20%5B%5C%5Cln%20q_K(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D_K)%20-%20%5C%5Clog%20p(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D_K)%5D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bq_0(z_0)%7D%20%5B%5C%5Cln%20q_0(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D_0)%5D%20-%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bq_0(z_0)%7D%20%5B%5C%5Clog%20p(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D_K)%5D%20-%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bq_0(z_0)%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bk%3D1%7D%5EK%20%5C%5Cln%20%7C1%20%2B%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bu%7D_k%5E%5C%5Ctop%20%5C%5Cpsi_k(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D_k)%7C%20%5C%5Cright%5D.%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcd00c65fddcadb1c1e4bfeb259711625.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22y6hYw%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u38d8c054"><li fid="u10c60bc3" data-lake-id="u7b7347a0" id="u7b7347a0"><span data-lake-id="u089de501" id="u089de501">归一化流及其对应的自由能界可以与任意变分优化方案结合使用，包括广义变分 EM。对于摊销变分推断，</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u23bee586" id="u23bee586" style="color: #70000D">作者使用深度神经网络构造推断模型，将观测变量</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F712ecf7894348e92d8779c3ee87eeeb0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22z3rjF%22%7D" style="color: #70000D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u52e97e1e" id="u52e97e1e" style="color: #70000D">映射为初始密度</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_0%3D%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(%5C%5Cmu%2C%5C%5Csigma)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9a95906359c384b66357765ab070cebd.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wlQQy%22%7D" style="color: #70000D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u97b216e6" id="u97b216e6" style="color: #70000D">的参数，其中</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmu%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5ED%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2a7d0cd87c95069064cb9226e9b7ddad.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22J8f6H%22%7D" style="color: #70000D"></card><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5ED%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdfee6917060cf689ba3691ad7f6e85cb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Hncbt%22%7D" style="color: #70000D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u6c0d5633" id="u6c0d5633" style="color: #70000D">，同时也映射得到归一化流的参数</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clambda%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe520c061a407db472027709bf3f73290.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22nO7gx%22%7D" style="color: #70000D"></card></li><li fid="u10c60bc3" data-lake-id="u13673b8a" id="u13673b8a"><span data-lake-id="u61cc87ad" id="u61cc87ad">在实验中，作者采用自由能的一个简单退火版本，其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta_t%5C%5Cin%5B0%2C1%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc399b5bdd4ed8fa4444f9145328d0a15.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22l25fR%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3184330c" id="u3184330c">是逆温度参数，其调度策略为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta_t%3D%5C%5Cmin(1%2C0.01%2Bt%2F10000).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd714a30e4f29d436c3871308c83c365f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Lxciy%22%7D"></card></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uacef8514" id="uacef8514" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboxed%7B%5Cn%5C%5Cmathcal%7BF%7D_%7B%5C%5Cbeta_t%7D(x)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bq_0(z_0)%7D%5B%5C%5Cln%20q_0(z_0)%5D%20-%20%5C%5Cbeta_t%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bq_0(z_0)%7D%5B%5C%5Clog%20p(x%2C%20z_K)%5D%20-%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bq_0(z_0)%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bk%3D1%7D%5EK%20%5C%5Cln%20%7C1%20%2B%20u_k%5E%5C%5Ctop%20%5C%5Cpsi_k(z_k)%7C%20%5C%5Cright%5D%2C%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7e7ec9c3223f2423ed3d7ef42b84cfa9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uWe7v%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u313e0e29" id="u313e0e29"><strong><span data-lake-id="ue4262d24" id="ue4262d24">算法概要与复杂度：由此得到的算法可以看作是对深度潜变量高斯模型中摊销推断算法的一种简单修改</span></strong></p><ul list="ua216e965"><li fid="ua3124bcb" data-lake-id="u3bd09949" id="u3bd09949"><span data-lake-id="u395ef247" id="u395ef247">其核心思想是使用一个推断网络根据输入数据</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20x%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F70a0f663ea24f20341612f0479fb18c1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JPVE1%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc7ab514a" id="uc7ab514a">直接预测近似后验分布的参数，并通过随机反向传播估计模型参数与变分参数的梯度。推断网络不仅输出初始分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F62ff4015bf1908d1ce2f6ea464d2018a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22K16G8%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u68d0afe6" id="u68d0afe6">的参数，还输出归一化流中各个变换的参数。整个推断过程可以被组织为一个单一的计算图，从而方便地对推断网络参数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cphi%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff547e08b7db926659f19deee4b4363d1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XxpHI%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u49c48e43" id="u49c48e43">和生成模型参数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fed5a4aa5e092e303a69c608582c70db9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BfFCn%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6419db7d" id="u6419db7d">同时进行梯度计算。</span></li><li fid="ua3124bcb" data-lake-id="u43c9afa6" id="u43c9afa6"><span data-lake-id="uf29cb369" id="uf29cb369">训练时，使用基于 Monte Carlo 的梯度估计，并结合随机反向传播对退火自由能目标进行优化。具体而言，在每一次参数更新中，对于每个数据点仅采样一个隐变量样本。该样本首先从初始分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_0(z_0)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa2d069087492ca68d2ee5bc75e170a5a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TDda1%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud7a4b55c" id="ud7a4b55c">中采样得到，随后依次通过</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22K%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F38a3f4d664b7a723d138f9d57be0c783.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22HOr7U%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u408fe4ac" id="u408fe4ac">个归一化流变换，最终得到</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z_K%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F87567281087da21d99fb0d6596cf42b7.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UToAT%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc02a40f6" id="uc02a40f6">。然后，模型根据</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z_K%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F87567281087da21d99fb0d6596cf42b7.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DQjBD%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uec7b03af" id="uec7b03af">计算生成项、初始分布项以及所有流变换的对数雅可比行列式修正项，从而形成自由能的 Monte Carlo 估计</span></li><li fid="ua3124bcb" data-lake-id="u50995c89" id="u50995c89"><span data-lake-id="u0b7ae8c9" id="u0b7ae8c9">得到的梯度估计随后与带预条件的随机梯度优化方法结合使用，例如 RMSprop 或 AdaGrad。其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CGamma_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F00e8e106f021ecf3ef071f6364380e64.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vyyV8%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u930e291c" id="u930e291c">是一个对角预条件矩阵，用于自适应地缩放不同参数方向上的梯度，从而加速自由能目标的最小化过程。参数更新形式可以表示为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u217e2ae9" id="u217e2ae9" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22(%5C%5Ctheta_%7Bt%2B1%7D%2C%5C%5Cphi_%7Bt%2B1%7D)%20%5C%5Cleftarrow%20(%5C%5Ctheta_t%2C%5C%5Cphi_t)%20%2B%20%5C%5CGamma_t(g_%5C%5Ctheta%5Et%2Cg_%5C%5Cphi%5Et)%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fde88716e837fdb8d7483ab9eb8987991.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wDw7w%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ucf8769a6"><li fid="u641fade0" data-lake-id="ud736dd70" id="ud736dd70"><span data-lake-id="u6fe1eddd" id="u6fe1eddd">从计算复杂度来看，推断网络前向传播的复杂度为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22O(LN%5E2)%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5e3c9283635b1d2e79cc913ecade1ac6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CvEzG%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2145a300" id="u2145a300">其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20L%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F97a65d824ef5766184877c3f711d3e69.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22HvG1i%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u813093af" id="u813093af">表示用于将数据映射到流参数的确定性网络层数，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22N%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F459f3c80a50b7be28751b0869ef5386a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uXTAB%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u93b3177b" id="u93b3177b">表示平均隐藏层宽度。归一化流部分的采样与对数雅可比行列式计算复杂度为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22O(KD)%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdb91966508ce2062bb1cfc20edb964b2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Bs2Ut%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue42e3bb3" id="ue42e3bb3">其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22K%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F38a3f4d664b7a723d138f9d57be0c783.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PjOOW%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u03010663" id="u03010663">是流的长度，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F558270b7f0a90c3c286b860273d106a0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AGZmO%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1ce46b72" id="u1ce46b72">是潜变量维度。因此，整个推断模型的计算复杂度为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22O(LN%5E2)%2BO(KD).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff8bb9cacf26cbfd38e366ca526745949.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZOfNE%22%7D"></card></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ue92886d1" id="ue92886d1" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1777261563984-3f4f0b88-a2b8-480a-93e6-4e7a91e5bcaf.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u47dbe106-b891-4db8-8c30-93aa285793a%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u5a595504-4807-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A414.45458984375%2C%22height%22%3A220%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A65678%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A871%2C%22originHeight%22%3A462%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.375%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22ALGORITHM1VARIATIONALINF.WITHNORMALIZING%22%2C%22x%22%3A13%2C%22y%22%3A21%2C%22width%22%3A699%2C%22height%22%3A34%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ZK%E4%B8%80FK0FK-10...0FI(Z0)%22%2C%22x%22%3A84%2C%22y%22%3A240%2C%22width%22%3A474%2C%22height%22%3A38%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PARAMETERSPVARIATIONAL%2C0%22%2C%22x%22%3A50%2C%22y%22%3A74%2C%22width%22%3A427%2C%22height%22%3A29%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WHILENOTCONVERGEDDO%22%2C%22x%22%3A48%2C%22y%22%3A117%2C%22width%22%3A348%2C%22height%22%3A30%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22X%3C%E4%B8%80GETMINI-BATCH%22%2C%22x%22%3A79%2C%22y%22%3A158%2C%22width%22%3A339%2C%22height%22%3A33%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220X%E4%B8%80V0F(X)%22%2C%22x%22%3A84%2C%22y%22%3A325%2C%22width%22%3A256%2C%22height%22%3A36%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22F(X)RF(XZK%22%2C%22x%22%3A82%2C%22y%22%3A283%2C%22width%22%3A269%2C%22height%22%3A35%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%ADX%E4%B8%80VF(X)%22%2C%22x%22%3A85%2C%22y%22%3A367%2C%22width%22%3A264%2C%22height%22%3A37%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22Z0~900X%22%2C%22x%22%3A83%2C%22y%22%3A201%2C%22width%22%3A201%2C%22height%22%3A33%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GENERATIVE%22%2C%22x%22%3A467%2C%22y%22%3A77%2C%22width%22%3A153%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ENDWHILE%22%2C%22x%22%3A46%2C%22y%22%3A414%2C%22width%22%3A159%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FLOWS%22%2C%22x%22%3A696%2C%22y%22%3A27%2C%22width%22%3A100%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23efefef%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u2842e9e7%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ue079a6db" id="ue079a6db"><strong><span data-lake-id="uc0dcf6cc" id="uc0dcf6cc" style="color: #101E60">与一般可逆神经网络中昂贵的雅可比行列式计算相比，平面流和径向流的关键优势在于：它们能够以线性时间计算密度变换所需的对数雅可比行列式，从而使基于流的灵活后验近似可以被实际用于深度潜变量模型的训练</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="ubc2c422c" id="ubc2c422c" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1777289751915-0b979d12-722e-489b-a562-d58e275c8858.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u0050faff-27da-49d8-b11e-6ca3fc87484%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ua45848b3-91b2-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A482.0909423828125%2C%22height%22%3A266%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A51254%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A898%2C%22originHeight%22%3A496%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.375%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22GENERATIVEMODEL%22%2C%22x%22%3A556%2C%22y%22%3A452%2C%22width%22%3A241%2C%22height%22%3A29%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LNFERENCENETWORK%22%2C%22x%22%3A107%2C%22y%22%3A455%2C%22width%22%3A247%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22000000%22%2C%22x%22%3A93%2C%22y%22%3A237%2C%22width%22%3A282%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OOOOO%22%2C%22x%22%3A563%2C%22y%22%3A239%2C%22width%22%3A255%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OOOOOO%22%2C%22x%22%3A87%2C%22y%22%3A305%2C%22width%22%3A282%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f1f1f1%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u2052e6aa%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><h1 data-lake-id="eUHYk" id="eUHYk" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="ub80463fa" id="ub80463fa">🕊️</span><span data-lake-id="udbef62d2" id="udbef62d2"> 𝐍𝐞𝐮𝐫𝐚𝐥 𝐎𝐫𝐝𝐢𝐧𝐚𝐫𝐲 𝐃𝐢𝐟𝐟𝐞𝐫𝐞𝐧𝐭𝐢𝐚𝐥 𝐄𝐪𝐮𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧𝐬</span></h1><p data-lake-id="u2207656e" id="u2207656e"><strong><span data-lake-id="u06e4b75c" id="u06e4b75c" style="color: rgb(34, 73, 254),rgb(199, 74, 168)">提出一类新的深度神经网络模型。不同于显式指定一个离散的隐藏层序列，使用神经网络来参数化隐藏状态的导数</span></strong></p><ul list="ufdd5c837"><li fid="u4a21cb88" data-lake-id="u419ec25c" id="u419ec25c"><strong><span data-lake-id="u2694898f" id="u2694898f" style="color: #70000D">模型的输出由黑箱微分方程求解器计算得到</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ub8ff1bb6" id="ub8ff1bb6">。此类连续深度模型在理论上具备恒定的内存开销，能够根据不同输入的复杂性自适应地调整数值求解策略，并允许在计算精度与推理效率之间进行显式权衡</span></li><li fid="u4a21cb88" data-lake-id="uda4100c6" id="uda4100c6"><strong><span data-lake-id="u5af268a5" id="u5af268a5" style="color: #2A4200">进一步构造连续归一化流模型。作为一类生成模型，该方法能够在无需对数据维度进行划分或重排的情况下，通过最大似然目标进行直接训练</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ua2fda991" id="ua2fda991">。在优化过程中，模型可以在不依赖 ODE 求解器内部实现细节的前提下，对任意黑箱求解过程进行可扩展的反向传播，从而使 ODE 模块能够被嵌入更大规模的神经网络系统中，并支持端到端训练</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u08a49e25" id="u08a49e25"><span data-lake-id="ub5a3a889" id="ub5a3a889">诸如残差网络、循环神经网络解码器以及归一化流等模型，通常通过对隐藏状态施加一系列变换，来构建复杂的状态变换过程：</span></p><p data-lake-id="u6a55705f" id="u6a55705f" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bh%7D_%7Bt%2B1%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bh%7D_t%2Bf(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bh%7D_t%2C%5C%5Ctheta_t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7b7fbc6b77d7c536f8e84f24e42fc7ec.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mmCKd%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u2e7538a4"><li fid="uf970034c" data-lake-id="u8f721208" id="u8f721208"><span data-lake-id="uf2cb92a7" id="uf2cb92a7">其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5C%7B0%2C%5C%5Cldots%2CT%5C%5C%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fef7899bfd3e4b90522d5956a85b494a5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OUrN1%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u82075493" id="u82075493">且</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bh%7D_t%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5ED%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F536a76a71e44558b17da692fa76a46f6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qkaib%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc53d54df" id="uc53d54df">。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ue6328a84" id="ue6328a84">这些迭代式更新可以被视为对某一连续变换的欧拉离散化</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ua31d6109" id="ua31d6109"><strong><span data-lake-id="ubccde334" id="ubccde334" style="color: rgb(42, 188, 191),rgb(56, 54, 221)">当不断增加网络层数，并同时减小每一步的更新幅度时，会发生什么？在极限情形下，使用由神经网络指定的常微分方程来参数化隐藏单元的连续动力学：</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u535bdd03" id="u535bdd03" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7Bd%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bh%7D(t)%7D%7Bdt%7D%3Df(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bh%7D(t)%2Ct%2C%5C%5Ctheta)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc8e60679765d057861a8aee56916052a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Dk8bo%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u1b3b3a0f"><li fid="u7cae8df6" data-lake-id="ud43b7bad" id="ud43b7bad"><strong><span data-lake-id="u6c6767ac" id="u6c6767ac" style="color: #5C0036">从输入层</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bh%7D(0)%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fde40223f2e8ac9683f075b70f0e1cb2f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22m5BRS%22%7D" style="color: #5C0036"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u7a440307" id="u7a440307" style="color: #5C0036">出发，我们可以将输出层</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bh%7D(T)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa049472076fb3a297536ddda53e94c4f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22aN4Wx%22%7D" style="color: #5C0036"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u4e5cb34d" id="u4e5cb34d" style="color: #5C0036">定义为该 ODE 初值问题在某一时间</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20T%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe653289cfaa7dc2d2b728c1d442d046a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22EEDG2%22%7D" style="color: #5C0036"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u366c13e6" id="u366c13e6" style="color: #5C0036">处的解。该值可以通过黑箱微分方程求解器计算得到；求解器会在必要的位置评估隐藏单元动力学函数</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F18f3c2855f0e85a1ac2257f64d917144.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22k3PfU%22%7D" style="color: #5C0036"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ufe58277f" id="ufe58277f" style="color: #5C0036">，以便以期望精度确定最终解</span></strong></li><li fid="u7cae8df6" data-lake-id="uc9d849b3" id="uc9d849b3"><span data-lake-id="u8f1030f7" id="u8f1030f7" style="color: #000000">残差网络定义一组有限的离散变换序列，ODE 网络定义一个向量场，该向量场以连续方式变换状态</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u3dd48db0" id="u3dd48db0" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1777475121836-05db1fd0-84b9-469c-a9c3-aa635b63dbb3.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u03a6bd3c-91b8-4c8d-9198-45231d21ea1%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u89ef565c-ad07-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A393.54547119140625%2C%22height%22%3A274%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A147908%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A856%2C%22originHeight%22%3A596%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.375%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22INPUT%2FHIDDEN%2FOUTPUT%22%2C%22x%22%3A89%2C%22y%22%3A553%2C%22width%22%3A295%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RESIDUALNETWORK%22%2C%22x%22%3A61%2C%22y%22%3A17%2C%22width%22%3A342%2C%22height%22%3A37%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22INPUT%2FHIDDEN%2FOUTPUT%22%2C%22x%22%3A525%2C%22y%22%3A553%2C%22width%22%3A296%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ODENETWORK%22%2C%22x%22%3A526%2C%22y%22%3A17%2C%22width%22%3A274%2C%22height%22%3A36%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%80%22%2C%22x%22%3A460%2C%22y%22%3A252%2C%22width%22%3A24%2C%22height%22%3A90%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E9%87%8F%22%2C%22x%22%3A26%2C%22y%22%3A253%2C%22width%22%3A23%2C%22height%22%3A93%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23ebe9e9%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u778a7da6%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u4aceff87" id="u4aceff87"><strong><span data-lake-id="u000947a2" id="u000947a2">使用 ODE 求解器定义并评估模型具有以下若干优势</span></strong></p><ul list="uab280c33"><li fid="u29f19f69" data-lake-id="u083ac3a0" id="u083ac3a0"><strong><span data-lake-id="uec1fc45c" id="uec1fc45c" style="color: #70000D">内存效率：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u0229b8a9" id="u0229b8a9">通过计算一个标量损失函数相对于任意 ODE 求解器输入的梯度，而无需通过求解器的内部运算过程进行反向传播。由于不需要存储前向传播中的任何中间量，模型训练时的内存开销可以作为深度的函数保持恒定</span></li><li fid="u29f19f69" data-lake-id="u2c4728f9" id="u2c4728f9"><strong><span data-lake-id="ueb974c61" id="ueb974c61" style="color: #70000D">自适应计算：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u399d5011" id="u399d5011">欧拉方法可能是求解 ODE 的最简单方法。现代 ODE 求解器能够对近似误差的增长进行控制，监测误差水平，并在计算过程中动态调整评估策略，以达到所要求的精度水平。这使得模型的评估成本能够随问题复杂度而变化。训练完成后，还可以降低求解精度，以适应实时应用或低功耗应用场景</span></li><li fid="u29f19f69" data-lake-id="u182620c8" id="u182620c8"><strong><span data-lake-id="u40c403b1" id="u40c403b1" style="color: #70000D">参数效率：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ud86aca80" id="ud86aca80">当隐藏单元的动力学被参数化为时间的连续函数时，相邻层的参数会自动绑定在一起</span></li><li fid="u29f19f69" data-lake-id="u0565aea0" id="u0565aea0"><strong><span data-lake-id="uc1357dd2" id="uc1357dd2" style="color: #70000D">可扩展且可逆的归一化流：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u035f7951" id="u035f7951">连续变换带来的一个意外优势是，变量替换公式变得更容易计算。利用它构造一类新的可逆密度模型。该模型避免归一化流中常见的单隐藏单元瓶颈，并且可以直接通过最大似然进行训练</span></li><li fid="u29f19f69" data-lake-id="u9a2f0a6c" id="u9a2f0a6c"><strong><span data-lake-id="udabbbf8e" id="udabbbf8e" style="color: #70000D">连续时间序列模型：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u5b6ad779" id="u5b6ad779">不同于循环神经网络需要将观测区间和发射区间离散化，连续定义的动力学能够自然整合在任意时间到达的数据</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="c7FVw" id="c7FVw" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u1e558110" id="u1e558110">🦨</span><span data-lake-id="u706ba689" id="u706ba689"> 𝑹𝒆𝒗𝒆𝒓𝒔𝒆-𝒎𝒐𝒅𝒆 𝒂𝒖𝒕𝒐𝒎𝒂𝒕𝒊𝒄 𝒅𝒊𝒇𝒇𝒆𝒓𝒆𝒏𝒕𝒊𝒂𝒕𝒊𝒐𝒏 𝒐𝒇 𝑶𝑫𝑬 𝒔𝒐𝒍𝒖𝒕𝒊𝒐𝒏𝒔</span></h2><p data-lake-id="uedec699b" id="uedec699b"><span data-lake-id="ud4870ad2" id="ud4870ad2">训练连续深度网络时面临的主要技术困难，</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u830d1ed3" id="u830d1ed3" style="color: #DF2A3F">是如何通过 ODE 求解器执行反向模式微分，也即通常所说的反向传播</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u4e1979d2" id="u4e1979d2">。直接对前向传播过程中的每一步运算进行微分虽然较为直接，但会带来较高的内存开销，并引入额外的数值误差</span></p><ul list="uc912b47b"><li fid="u09f5ef1e" data-lake-id="u3e4df6f2" id="u3e4df6f2"><span data-lake-id="u772a8ffe" id="u772a8ffe">论文将 ODE 求解器视为一个黑箱，并采用</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u25a81758" id="u25a81758">伴随敏感度方法</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uffc82869" id="uffc82869">来计算梯度。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ufb0b46f2" id="ufb0b46f2" style="color: #5C0036">该方法通过在时间上反向求解一个增广的 ODE 系统来获得梯度，适用于任意 ODE 求解器。该方法的计算复杂度随问题规模线性增长，具有较低的内存开销，并且能够显式控制数值误差</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u270de382" id="u270de382"><span data-lake-id="u0bea3501" id="u0bea3501">考虑优化一个标量损失函数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20L(%5C%5Ccdot)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F34b3ff8bb33b58aafc1034339b657bd8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jTa7K%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2bf75ae2" id="u2bf75ae2">，其输入为 ODE 求解器的输出</span></p><p data-lake-id="u4f620fca" id="u4f620fca" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboxed%7B%5CnL(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t_1))%20%3D%20L%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t_0)%20%2B%20%5C%5Cint_%7Bt_0%7D%5E%7Bt_1%7D%20f(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t)%2C%20t%2C%20%5C%5Ctheta)dt%20%5C%5Cright)%20%3D%20L(%5C%5Cmathrm%7BODESolve%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t_0)%2C%20f%2C%20t_0%2C%20t_1%2C%20%5C%5Ctheta))%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff313843dbc4a4efaa44fed5579f4507c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22NChbv%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u665d0e01" id="u665d0e01"><span data-lake-id="u5c062289" id="u5c062289">为优化</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20L%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F97a65d824ef5766184877c3f711d3e69.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AU0WK%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5333320e" id="u5333320e">，需要计算其关于参数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fed5a4aa5e092e303a69c608582c70db9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hdr1K%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6a38cc50" id="u6a38cc50">的梯度。第一步是确定损失函数的梯度如何在每一个时刻依赖于隐藏状态</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20z(t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe9d339506628748127dd4eb314427772.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cCBlH%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u04617cb4" id="u04617cb4">。该量被称为伴随变量</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22a(t)%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20L%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20z(t)%7D.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F95dce5a221ef6464e03a7d2654aaed9c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22aP4Nf%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5b60e388" id="u5b60e388">其动态演化由另一个 ODE 给出，可以将其理解为链式法则在连续时间情形下的瞬时对应形式：</span></p><p data-lake-id="u498c1dc2" id="u498c1dc2" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboxed%7B%5Cn%5C%5Cfrac%7Bda(t)%7D%7Bdt%7D%20%3D%20-a(t)%5E%5C%5Ctop%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20f(z(t)%2C%20t%2C%20%5C%5Ctheta)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20z%7D%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F13b9233b99a88dea048dd337163d71b9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22k1Fbg%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u2ac24770" id="u2ac24770"><strong><span data-lake-id="u69ce8590" id="u69ce8590" style="color: #004347">可以通过再次调用 ODE 求解器来计算</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpartial%20L%2F%5C%5Cpartial%20z(t_0)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F987bd66492770dd80a2208637206f8a0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VF11U%22%7D" style="color: #004347"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ud50c1280" id="ud50c1280" style="color: #004347">。这一求解器需要沿时间反向运行，其初始值为</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpartial%20L%2F%5C%5Cpartial%20z(t_1)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F672d403b9f93bbee8c935a8749dcc0b9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WaID8%22%7D" style="color: #004347"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uc7bf1158" id="uc7bf1158" style="color: #004347">。复杂之处在于求解该 ODE 需要知道整条轨迹上的</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20z(t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe9d339506628748127dd4eb314427772.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WTuv5%22%7D" style="color: #004347"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u22a65486" id="u22a65486" style="color: #004347">取值。然而，可以在反向求解伴随变量的同时，从终点</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20z(t_1)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7dd7c03e5a3cd5246343f07e913261db.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fzBeh%22%7D" style="color: #004347"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u7011e52b" id="u7011e52b" style="color: #004347">出发，重新计算</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z(t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf52d701ecffcd4192ff93163a7d8607.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22l6aya%22%7D" style="color: #004347"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u322e884a" id="u322e884a" style="color: #004347">的轨迹</span></strong></p><ul list="u918be5ee"><li fid="ua4793e1f" data-lake-id="u2fdb5efd" id="u2fdb5efd"><span data-lake-id="u2c1af60d" id="u2c1af60d">ODE 解的反向模式微分过程。伴随敏感度方法通过沿时间反向求解一个增广 ODE 系统来完成梯度计算。该增广系统同时包含原始状态，以及损失函数相对于状态的敏感度。如果损失函数直接依赖于多个观测时刻处的状态，则在每一个观测时刻，伴随状态都必须按照损失函数相对于该观测状态的偏导方向进行更新</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u599b3f1d" id="u599b3f1d" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1777476551793-c4bdf79b-2cd1-4ae7-9671-9cb6af6c258d.png%3Fx-oss-process%3Dimage%252Fformat%252Cwebp%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A379%2C%22height%22%3A267%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A789%2C%22originHeight%22%3A556%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.375%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23fafafa%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qxnts%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u6d52366c" id="u6d52366c"><span data-lake-id="ud8250b8e" id="ud8250b8e">关于参数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fed5a4aa5e092e303a69c608582c70db9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UytNc%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u387e257b" id="u387e257b">的梯度计算需要进一步求解第三个积分，该积分同时依赖于状态</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20z(t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe9d339506628748127dd4eb314427772.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OI0Na%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u25adf76e" id="u25adf76e">与伴随变量</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22a(t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbcf05b7dd9067d399a476a1112fb73fc.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22dqrcH%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="uf8fd8b6f" id="uf8fd8b6f" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboxed%7B%5Cn%5C%5Cfrac%7BdL%7D%7Bd%5C%5Ctheta%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cint_%7Bt_1%7D%5E%7Bt_0%7D%20a(t)%5E%5C%5Ctop%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20f(z(t)%2C%20t%2C%20%5C%5Ctheta)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Ctheta%7D%20dt%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F79040ee6c76973a25265bca1f39657bc.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kb78n%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u2743b6d6" id="u2743b6d6"><span data-lake-id="u175b4ba1" id="u175b4ba1">式中出现的向量-雅可比积</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22a(t)%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20f%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20z%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fba7b144998a6dbe30933975990b46124.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22EDHHC%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ufaa3bb7b" id="ufaa3bb7b">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22a(t)%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20f%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Ctheta%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8d556ca7cd409c40ab977c6316481f8e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Ihs83%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue0b07d35" id="ue0b07d35">可以通过自动微分高效计算，其时间成本与一次函数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F18f3c2855f0e85a1ac2257f64d917144.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wobm8%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u53a341bc" id="u53a341bc">的评估成本相近。用于求解的所有积分，都可以在一次 ODE 求解器调用中同时完成：具体而言，可以将原始状态、伴随变量以及其他偏导项拼接为一个统一的向量</span></p><p data-lake-id="uba10f494" id="uba10f494" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u20a3eea2" id="u20a3eea2"> </span><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1777476412702-efc945fc-0fa5-4524-91ec-e04dd7236e17.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u0903490a-06dc-41ed-8833-72b0a0db920%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u034cc351-9c12-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A799.6364135742188%2C%22height%22%3A224%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A109814%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1248%2C%22originHeight%22%3A350%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.375%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%3ADYNAMICSPARAMETERS0STARTTIMETN%2CSTOPTIMET%2CFINALSTATEZ(T)%2CLOSSGRADIENTOL%2FOZ(T%2C)%22%2C%22x%22%3A83%2C%22y%22%3A76%2C%22width%22%3A1122%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22O)%2C%E5%85%AD%E4%B8%80%2C-%3DODESOLVE(SO%2CAUG_DYNAMICS%2CTI%2CT%22%2C%22x%22%3A86%2C%22y%22%3A238%2C%22width%22%3A645%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RETURN%5BF(Z(T)%2CT%2C0)%2C-A(T)S%2C-A(T)%22%2C%22x%22%3A77%2C%22y%22%3A193%2C%22width%22%3A533%2C%22height%22%3A31%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DEFAUGDYNAMICS(Z(T)%2CA(T)%2C%2CT%2C0%22%2C%22x%22%3A41%2C%22y%22%3A156%2C%22width%22%3A456%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%3EDEFNEDYNAMICSONAUGMENTEDSTATE%22%2C%22x%22%3A748%2C%22y%22%3A159%2C%22width%22%3A487%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22COMPUTEVECTOR-JACOBIANPRODUCTS%22%2C%22x%22%3A755%2C%22y%22%3A197%2C%22width%22%3A478%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DEFNEINITIALAUGMENTEDSTATE%22%2C%22x%22%3A834%2C%22y%22%3A117%2C%22width%22%3A400%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ALGORITHM1REVERSE-MODEDERIVATIVEOFANODEINTIALVALUEPROBLEM%22%2C%22x%22%3A10%2C%22y%22%3A28%2C%22width%22%3A881%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SOLVEREVERSE-TIMEODE%22%2C%22x%22%3A903%2C%22y%22%3A242%2C%22width%22%3A335%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%89(1)%22%2C%22x%22%3A69%2C%22y%22%3A116%2C%22width%22%3A199%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PRETURNGRADIENTS%22%2C%22x%22%3A1004%2C%22y%22%3A287%2C%22width%22%3A231%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A121%2C%22y%22%3A288%2C%22width%22%3A114%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RETURN%22%2C%22x%22%3A15%2C%22y%22%3A288%2C%22width%22%3A93%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OZ(TO)O%22%2C%22x%22%3A110%2C%22y%22%3A254%2C%22width%22%3A133%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22Z(T)%E5%A7%8B%22%2C%22x%22%3A45%2C%22y%22%3A237%2C%22width%22%3A137%2C%22height%22%3A32%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OL%22%2C%22x%22%3A131%2C%22y%22%3A279%2C%22width%22%3A57%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23eaeaea%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u59211654%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u1b16cbea" id="u1b16cbea"><span data-lake-id="ua29bfa4a" id="ua29bfa4a">大多数 ODE 求解器都支持在多个时间点输出状态</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z(t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf52d701ecffcd4192ff93163a7d8607.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QSb4h%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4381282b" id="u4381282b">。当损失函数依赖于这些中间状态时，反向模式微分必须被拆分为一系列独立的求解过程，即在每一对相邻输出时间点之间分别进行求解。在每一个观测时刻，伴随变量都需要根据相应的偏导数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20L%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20z(t_i)%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F88558ee60e9812fc2cbe54aedf9a9abf.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mC944%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0960c702" id="u0960c702">进行修正</span></p><h2 data-lake-id="E959g" id="E959g" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u54d5ce2c" id="u54d5ce2c">🦥</span><span data-lake-id="ud5de22ca" id="ud5de22ca"> 𝑪𝒐𝒏𝒕𝒊𝒏𝒖𝒐𝒖𝒔 𝑵𝒐𝒓𝒎𝒂𝒍𝒊𝒛𝒊𝒏𝒈 𝑭𝒍𝒐𝒘𝒔</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u89ea4fd1" id="u89ea4fd1"><strong><span data-lake-id="u3c72458c" id="u3c72458c">离散化形式的方程同样出现在归一化流以及 NICE 框架中。这类方法利用变量替换定理来精确计算样本在经过双射函数</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20f%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F93d9083c18a4e52919e9c11f99836398.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ssApI%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u378d0c23" id="u378d0c23">变换后，其概率密度所发生的变化：</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u6fa9f43b" id="u6fa9f43b" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboxed%7B%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D_1%20%3D%20f(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D_0)%20%5C%5Cimplies%20%5C%5Clog%20p(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D_1)%20%3D%20%5C%5Clog%20p(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D_0)%20-%20%5C%5Clog%20%5C%5Cleft%7C%20%5C%5Cdet%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20f%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D_0%7D%20%5C%5Cright%7C%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F38ed1ccc779aa77c29159a742c666149.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22yTDmY%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u38e5c9a6" id="u38e5c9a6"><strong><span data-lake-id="u0522c8b3" id="u0522c8b3">一个典型例子是平面归一化流和其对应的对数密度变化为：</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="ub22688f4" id="ub22688f4" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboxed%7B%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t%2B1)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t)%20%2B%20u%20h(w%5E%5C%5Ctop%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t)%20%2B%20b)%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Clog%20p(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t%2B1))%20%3D%20%5C%5Clog%20p(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t))%20-%20%5C%5Clog%20%5C%5Cleft%7C%201%20%2B%20u%5E%5C%5Ctop%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20h%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cright%7C%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc607b04999fc9f3e3e600ea353142742.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22GXG89%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u12f9cb30" id="u12f9cb30"><strong><span data-lake-id="u4567daae" id="u4567daae" style="color: #665800">一般而言，使用变量替换公式时的主要瓶颈在于，需要计算雅可比矩阵</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpartial%20f%2F%5C%5Cpartial%20z%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbd8d5244902e09fa9d2c8ba69d679317.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Ql6Ub%22%7D" style="color: #665800"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u98825ad4" id="u98825ad4" style="color: #665800">的行列式。该计算的复杂度通常会随着状态维度</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20z%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe88346e0623a551732d563f057199515.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22dzkTr%22%7D" style="color: #665800"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ub824e2b5" id="ub824e2b5" style="color: #665800">或隐藏单元数量呈三次增长</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uc85175f8" id="uc85175f8">。因此，已有研究通常需要在归一化流层数与计算代价之间进行权衡。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u94b23af8" id="u94b23af8" style="color: #004347">将模型从离散层序列推广到连续变换后，归一化常数变化的计算反而得到简化</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u55e59d4f" id="u55e59d4f"><strong><span data-lake-id="u03d2576e" id="u03d2576e" style="color: rgb(255, 111, 4),rgb(243, 48, 171)">瞬时变量替换公式：设</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z(t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf52d701ecffcd4192ff93163a7d8607.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22O1OnD%22%7D" style="color: rgb(255, 111, 4),rgb(243, 48, 171)"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uac6ffe55" id="uac6ffe55" style="color: rgb(255, 111, 4),rgb(243, 48, 171)">是一个随时间变化的有限连续随机变量，其概率密度为</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20p(z(t))%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb410281558c7ad8700306b24a6fc3f9b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22y8aRf%22%7D" style="color: rgb(255, 111, 4),rgb(243, 48, 171)"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ub4fa0e42" id="ub4fa0e42" style="color: rgb(255, 111, 4),rgb(243, 48, 171)">。设</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7Bdz%7D%7Bdt%7D%3Df(z(t)%2Ct)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffea38024e7b4e5d38823b00fb10792a2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bkdDT%22%7D" style="color: rgb(255, 111, 4),rgb(243, 48, 171)"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u839f6c98" id="u839f6c98" style="color: rgb(255, 111, 4),rgb(243, 48, 171)">为描述</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20z(t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe9d339506628748127dd4eb314427772.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TyuC1%22%7D" style="color: rgb(255, 111, 4),rgb(243, 48, 171)"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u1f4d6ae4" id="u1f4d6ae4" style="color: rgb(255, 111, 4),rgb(243, 48, 171)">连续时间变换的微分方程。若</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20f%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F93d9083c18a4e52919e9c11f99836398.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hMz5j%22%7D" style="color: rgb(255, 111, 4),rgb(243, 48, 171)"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uecc6a54b" id="uecc6a54b" style="color: rgb(255, 111, 4),rgb(243, 48, 171)">关于</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F02bab26178a0cd05dae15ad487830237.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22yR6HH%22%7D" style="color: rgb(255, 111, 4),rgb(243, 48, 171)"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u3ae937d2" id="u3ae937d2" style="color: rgb(255, 111, 4),rgb(243, 48, 171)">一致 Lipschitz 连续，并且关于</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd99979941e2b40b5ffd75f89c83e37b4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xBAda%22%7D" style="color: rgb(255, 111, 4),rgb(243, 48, 171)"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uab6cc539" id="uab6cc539" style="color: rgb(255, 111, 4),rgb(243, 48, 171)">连续，则对数概率密度的变化同样满足一个微分方程：</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u80b60111" id="u80b60111" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboxed%7B%5Cn%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Clog%20p(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t))%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20t%7D%20%3D%20-%5C%5Cmathrm%7Btr%7D%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bdf%7D%7Bd%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t)%7D%20%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F88558420344c1e7d4887ae3052486b3c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AfRqH%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card></p><ul list="ua692901b"><li fid="u10ccdbd6" data-lake-id="ue36afa31" id="ue36afa31"><span data-lake-id="u700782b3" id="u700782b3">在连续时间设定下，只需要计算雅可比矩阵的迹。此外，与标准的有限层归一化流不同，微分方程中的动力学函数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20f%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F93d9083c18a4e52919e9c11f99836398.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22SO7a7%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ufc4e12e5" id="ufc4e12e5">本身并不需要显式满足双射条件；只要 ODE 解的唯一性得到保证，整个连续变换就会自动构成双射</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u6e23e8b1" id="u6e23e8b1"><strong><span data-lake-id="u300d605a" id="u300d605a">作为瞬时变量替换公式的一个应用例子，可以考察平面流的连续时间对应形式，以及其归一化常数的变化</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u36e8c148" id="u36e8c148">。给定初始分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p(z(0))%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa2d15f000dad5fce1e27ebb186e6b8a0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZlWFq%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2b9d5f49" id="u2b9d5f49">，可以通过求解这一联合 ODE，从而从</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p(z(t))%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1c2b62e43262f528b38a7c1ecc37a172.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22S7fO9%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7c48b36f" id="u7c48b36f">中采样，并同时评估样本在该时刻的概率密度</span></p><p data-lake-id="ud39b5157" id="ud39b5157" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboxed%7B%5Cn%5C%5Cfrac%7Bd%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t)%7D%7Bdt%7D%20%3D%20u%20h(w%5E%5C%5Ctop%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t)%20%2B%20b)%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Clog%20p(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t))%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20t%7D%20%3D%20-u%5E%5C%5Ctop%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20h%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t)%7D%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7c4e53f48ef111f02d1787b7bf66c37f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Gff17%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="uc510a26c" id="uc510a26c"><strong><span data-lake-id="u32a4a089" id="u32a4a089">NICE 模型的连续时间对应形式可以被看作一种哈密顿流：将数据划分为两个等维部分，并构造一种保体积变换，有</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Clog%20p(z)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20t%7D%3D0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F49552c17fc3c614f81e043beb4e7e375.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PKPk3%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ub9ace9ae" id="ub9ace9ae" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Bbmatrix%7D%20%5C%5Cdfrac%7Bd%20z_%7B1%3Ad%7D%7D%7Bdt%7D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B4pt%5D%20%5C%5Cdfrac%7Bd%20z_%7Bd%2B1%3AD%7D%7D%7Bdt%7D%20%5C%5Cend%7Bbmatrix%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cbegin%7Bbmatrix%7D%20f(z_%7Bd%2B1%3AD%7D)%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%20g(z_%7B1%3Ad%7D)%20%5C%5Cend%7Bbmatrix%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3ee30fa1b22c00a87a47df032c4afd69.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22iX2k6%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u77ce23c6"><li fid="ue61bcc80" data-lake-id="u932423f4" id="u932423f4"><span data-lake-id="ucc39250d" id="ucc39250d">由于该动力学对应的雅可比矩阵在对角线上全为零，因此其迹为零。所以该变换不会改变体积，即它是一个保体积流</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u2c4a173c" id="u2c4a173c"><strong><span data-lake-id="u2e37fce2" id="u2e37fce2">使用多个隐藏单元且仅具有线性计算成本：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ub291e9f5" id="ub291e9f5">虽然行列式函数并不是线性的，但迹运算是线性的。即</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7Btr%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Csum_n%20J_n%5C%5Cright)%20%3D%20%5C%5Csum_n%20%5C%5Coperatorname%7Btr%7D(J_n).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F442751c844ac948936a8fba0f609f440.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22scLJD%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u57c76934" id="u57c76934">这意味着，如果动力学函数由多个函数之和给出，那么对数密度的微分方程同样可以写成求和形式：</span></p><p data-lake-id="uf28b5089" id="uf28b5089" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboxed%7B%5Cn%5C%5Cfrac%7Bd%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t)%7D%7Bdt%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bn%3D1%7D%5EM%20f_n(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t))%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bd%5C%5Clog%20p(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t))%7D%7Bdt%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bn%3D1%7D%5EM%20%5C%5Cmathrm%7Btr%7D%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20f_n%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5b6f880321a39e60ad08d89039c312d1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wIiP8%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ud435a7b3"><li fid="uda5b98c9" data-lake-id="uae15c38a" id="uae15c38a"><span data-lake-id="uca146e03" id="uca146e03">可以以较低成本评估包含大量隐藏单元的流模型，其计算复杂度仅随隐藏单元数量</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20M%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb94a7267a8199420f7bbc0afffecc851.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22oaan1%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3c52fc41" id="u3c52fc41">线性增长。相比之下，在标准归一化流中评估这类宽流层通常需要</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22O(M%5E3)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3363af3765449d4a670d8e514363c915.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22nrlrU%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubba970f6" id="ubba970f6">的计算代价，这也是传统归一化流架构往往采用多层、但每层仅包含较少隐藏单元的重要原因</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uc40ab35b" id="uc40ab35b"><strong><span data-lake-id="u8f6e34ac" id="u8f6e34ac">时间依赖动力学：可以将流模型的参数指定为时间</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcead1760d9d5723460c4b8d4028f113a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vi2HX%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u3eda8e0e" id="u3eda8e0e">的函数，使微分方程中的动力学函数</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f(z(t)%2Ct)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0ecb9ad71d3b3230117aaafcfb8d4698.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gAuPS%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u64aabded" id="u64aabded">随时间发生变化。这种参数化方式可以看作一种超网络形式。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u4f7c8d75" id="u4f7c8d75">此外，作者还为每个隐藏单元引入门控机制</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7Bdz%7D%7Bdt%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Csum_n%20%5C%5Csigma_n(t)%20f_n(z).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb02f005783e462650667d066607d63bb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LBNZp%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua6e75c44" id="ua6e75c44">  其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma_n(t)%5C%5Cin(0%2C1)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcd68b19cd036d72906116a1b04b87c39.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bEtOD%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u82560603" id="u82560603">是由神经网络学习得到的门控函数，用于决定动态函数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f_n(z)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0ab5c4ea5e9ef1b67ee18718f77cff71.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rI29c%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6dcfa14c" id="u6dcfa14c">应当在何时发挥作用。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u2799a33d" id="u2799a33d" style="color: #004347">作者将这类模型称为连续归一化流（Continuous Normalizing Flows）</span></strong></p><h2 data-lake-id="hcanf" id="hcanf" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u233e3eec" id="u233e3eec">🦫</span><span data-lake-id="u7d2f9f38" id="u7d2f9f38"> </span><span data-lake-id="uad054e22" id="uad054e22" style="color: #000000">𝑷𝒓𝒐𝒐𝒇 𝒐𝒇 𝒕𝒉𝒆 𝑰𝒏𝒔𝒕𝒂𝒏𝒕𝒂𝒏𝒆𝒐𝒖𝒔 𝑪𝒉𝒂𝒏𝒈𝒆 𝒐𝒇 𝑽𝒂𝒓𝒊𝒂𝒃𝒍𝒆𝒔 𝑻𝒉𝒆𝒐𝒓𝒆𝒎</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u19f66aa3" id="u19f66aa3"><strong><span data-lake-id="u94f4a20e" id="u94f4a20e">瞬时变量替换公式：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u49569a73" id="u49569a73">设</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z(t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf52d701ecffcd4192ff93163a7d8607.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rPzOo%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0ceb0a62" id="u0ceb0a62">是一个有限维连续随机变量，其概率密度</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p(z(t))%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1c2b62e43262f528b38a7c1ecc37a172.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Tl0zi%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9b31abcd" id="u9b31abcd">随时间变化。设</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7Bdz%7D%7Bdt%7D%3Df(z(t)%2Ct)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffea38024e7b4e5d38823b00fb10792a2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ma4Mx%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u435fe79b" id="u435fe79b">为描述</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20z(t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe9d339506628748127dd4eb314427772.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JRS5M%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u87b42793" id="u87b42793">连续时间变换的微分方程。若</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20f%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F93d9083c18a4e52919e9c11f99836398.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QB2Wi%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u76de8a63" id="u76de8a63">关于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20z%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe88346e0623a551732d563f057199515.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZQ7vL%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0626c9af" id="u0626c9af">一致 Lipschitz 连续，并且关于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd99979941e2b40b5ffd75f89c83e37b4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cUN6V%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u51683c46" id="u51683c46">连续，则对数概率密度的变化同样满足如下微分方程</span></p><p data-lake-id="u7f1d286d" id="u7f1d286d" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Clog%20p(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t))%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20t%7D%20%3D%20-%5C%5Cmathrm%7Btr%7D%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bdf%7D%7Bd%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t)%7D%20%5C%5Cright)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6f040300ca8a2492122658dff3d78302.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22KNHcg%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u802ace40" id="u802ace40"><strong><span data-lake-id="uae4bc60d" id="uae4bc60d">𝑷𝒓𝒐𝒐𝒇：考虑</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clog%20p(z(t))%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa928c155c4213ad18c8ad22c4b80302d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WWdjk%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uabf7995c" id="uabf7995c">在时间上的有限变化，并取其无穷小极限。首先，将时间发生一个无穷小变化</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cvarepsilon%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc57c5f0e31d8960d9406bb149fced9e0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UeoO0%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ucaa2dd88" id="ucaa2dd88">时</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F02bab26178a0cd05dae15ad487830237.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WL6rV%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ufb0e6a95" id="ufb0e6a95">的变换记为：</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u883fe9cd" id="u883fe9cd" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z(t%2B%5C%5Cvarepsilon)%3DT_%7B%5C%5Cvarepsilon%7D(z(t))%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F46f108991046e9b7c88e1c72f8d4b996.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UxsAC%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u6b433a08" id="u6b433a08"><span data-lake-id="u06db6baf" id="u06db6baf">假设</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F18f3c2855f0e85a1ac2257f64d917144.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tQX4I%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u904e47b7" id="u904e47b7">关于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z(t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf52d701ecffcd4192ff93163a7d8607.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CX5O9%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9edc7be0" id="u9edc7be0">满足 Lipschitz 连续性，并且关于时间</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd99979941e2b40b5ffd75f89c83e37b4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BA0hG%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue3f1a1c9" id="ue3f1a1c9">连续。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u8c691cd2" id="u8c691cd2" style="color: #663000">因此，根据 Picard 存在唯一性定理，每一个初值问题都存在唯一解</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u2d1eeff6" id="u2d1eeff6">。同时还假设</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20z(t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe9d339506628748127dd4eb314427772.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QwaUe%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc0d820fa" id="uc0d820fa">是有界的。这些条件意味着</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f%2CT_%7B%5C%5Cvarepsilon%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcea0706580bca3ec394da99fe6d66b1f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jd7b8%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub24feb59" id="ub24feb59">以及变换</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22T_%7B%5C%5Cvarepsilon%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc7dcfd3f89cf4cf84d17483ca45cff57.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Zl83l%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ufe0ab0f1" id="ufe0ab0f1">关于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20z%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe88346e0623a551732d563f057199515.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DzIAr%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue4d0b25a" id="ue4d0b25a">的雅可比矩阵</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20T_%5C%5Cepsilon%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20z%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6cbb51eee0a8f02f2bc92918496ecd0c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ebPCG%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u73876ae8" id="u73876ae8">都是有界的</span></p><p data-lake-id="u5be579e5" id="u5be579e5"><span data-lake-id="u37180bb8" id="u37180bb8">1️⃣</span><span data-lake-id="u204c0439" id="u204c0439"> 利用离散变量替换公式以及导数的定义，写出</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Clog%20p(z(t))%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7f3f5b4414e0b9205b6867f66290cba1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rZ9v4%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u69994b20" id="u69994b20">关于时间的变化率</span></p><p data-lake-id="uf2d87d72" id="uf2d87d72" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Clog%20p(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t))%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20t%7D%20%26%3D%20%5C%5Clim_%7B%5C%5Cvarepsilon%20%5C%5Cto%200%5E%2B%7D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Clog%20p(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t))%20-%20%5C%5Clog%20%5C%5Cleft%7C%20%5C%5Cdet%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D%7D%20T_%5C%5Cvarepsilon(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t))%20%5C%5Cright%7C%20-%20%5C%5Clog%20p(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t))%7D%7B%5C%5Cvarepsilon%7D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%20-%20%5C%5Clim_%7B%5C%5Cvarepsilon%20%5C%5Cto%200%5E%2B%7D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Clog%20%5C%5Cleft%7C%20%5C%5Cdet%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D%7D%20T_%5C%5Cvarepsilon(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t))%20%5C%5Cright%7C%7D%7B%5C%5Cvarepsilon%7D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%20-%20%5C%5Clim_%7B%5C%5Cvarepsilon%20%5C%5Cto%200%5E%2B%7D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Cvarepsilon%7D%20%5C%5Clog%20%5C%5Cleft%7C%20%5C%5Cdet%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D%7D%20T_%5C%5Cvarepsilon(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t))%20%5C%5Cright%7C%7D%7B%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Cvarepsilon%7D%20%5C%5Cvarepsilon%7D%20%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Ctext%7B(by%20L'H%C3%B4pital's%20rule)%7D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%20-%20%5C%5Clim_%7B%5C%5Cvarepsilon%20%5C%5Cto%200%5E%2B%7D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Cvarepsilon%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%7C%20%5C%5Cdet%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D%7D%20T_%5C%5Cvarepsilon(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t))%20%5C%5Cright%7C%7D%7B%5C%5Cleft%7C%20%5C%5Cdet%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D%7D%20T_%5C%5Cvarepsilon(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t))%20%5C%5Cright%7C%7D%20%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cleft.%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Clog(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cright%7C_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D%3D1%7D%20%3D%201%20%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%20-%20%5C%5Cunderbrace%7B%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Clim_%7B%5C%5Cvarepsilon%20%5C%5Cto%200%5E%2B%7D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Cvarepsilon%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%7C%20%5C%5Cdet%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D%7D%20T_%5C%5Cvarepsilon(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t))%20%5C%5Cright%7C%20%5C%5Cright)%20%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bbounded%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cunderbrace%7B%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Clim_%7B%5C%5Cvarepsilon%20%5C%5Cto%200%5E%2B%7D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%5C%5Cleft%7C%20%5C%5Cdet%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D%7D%20T_%5C%5Cvarepsilon(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t))%20%5C%5Cright%7C%7D%20%5C%5Cright)%20%7D_%7B%3D1%7D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%20-%20%5C%5Clim_%7B%5C%5Cvarepsilon%20%5C%5Cto%200%5E%2B%7D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Cvarepsilon%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%7C%20%5C%5Cdet%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D%7D%20T_%5C%5Cvarepsilon(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t))%20%5C%5Cright%7C%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F10ff8ffb80f51f4da636c2aa096e6416.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22p1h1z%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u65bab3e7" id="u65bab3e7"><span data-lake-id="uf5f40eed" id="uf5f40eed">2️⃣</span><span data-lake-id="uaff230c5" id="uaff230c5"> 利用 Jacobi 公式来表示行列式的导数</span></p><p data-lake-id="u63ef3f97" id="u63ef3f97" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Clog%20p(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t))%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20t%7D%20%26%3D%20-%20%5C%5Clim_%7B%5C%5Cvarepsilon%20%5C%5Cto%200%5E%2B%7D%20%5C%5Cmathrm%7Btr%7D%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cmathrm%7Badj%7D%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D%7D%20T_%5C%5Cvarepsilon(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t))%20%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Cvarepsilon%7D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D%7D%20T_%5C%5Cvarepsilon(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t))%20%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%20-%5C%5Cmathrm%7Btr%7D%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cunderbrace%7B%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Clim_%7B%5C%5Cvarepsilon%20%5C%5Cto%200%5E%2B%7D%20%5C%5Cmathrm%7Badj%7D%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D%7D%20T_%5C%5Cvarepsilon(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t))%20%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Cright)%20%7D_%7B%3DI%7D%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Clim_%7B%5C%5Cvarepsilon%20%5C%5Cto%200%5E%2B%7D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Cvarepsilon%7D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D%7D%20T_%5C%5Cvarepsilon(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t))%20%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%20-%5C%5Cmathrm%7Btr%7D%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Clim_%7B%5C%5Cvarepsilon%20%5C%5Cto%200%5E%2B%7D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Cvarepsilon%7D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D%7D%20T_%5C%5Cvarepsilon(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t))%20%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F97b225a282559d75016497b3a499a382.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DK5nN%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ucc856e19" id="ucc856e19"><span data-lake-id="u3158f81d" id="u3158f81d">3️⃣</span><span data-lake-id="uf385ff73" id="uf385ff73"> 将</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22T_%7B%5C%5Cvarepsilon%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc7dcfd3f89cf4cf84d17483ca45cff57.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cl9Ma%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u536bd5fe" id="u536bd5fe">用其 Taylor 展开代入。由于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20z(t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe9d339506628748127dd4eb314427772.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uFwsy%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u21c3fb54" id="u21c3fb54">在无穷小时间</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cvarepsilon%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc57c5f0e31d8960d9406bb149fced9e0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CL3Ql%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u79631f51" id="u79631f51">内按照动力学函数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20f%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F93d9083c18a4e52919e9c11f99836398.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22x3SGw%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1fd7e504" id="u1fd7e504">演化，因此有</span></p><p data-lake-id="u49b4be05" id="u49b4be05" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Clog%20p(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t))%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20t%7D%20%26%3D%20-%5C%5Cmathrm%7Btr%7D%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Clim_%7B%5C%5Cvarepsilon%20%5C%5Cto%200%5E%2B%7D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Cvarepsilon%7D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D%7D%20(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D%20%2B%20%5C%5Cvarepsilon%20f(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t)%2C%20t)%20%2B%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BO%7D(%5C%5Cvarepsilon%5E2)%20%2B%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BO%7D(%5C%5Cvarepsilon%5E3)%20%2B%20%5C%5Cdots)%20%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%20-%5C%5Cmathrm%7Btr%7D%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Clim_%7B%5C%5Cvarepsilon%20%5C%5Cto%200%5E%2B%7D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Cvarepsilon%7D%20%5C%5Cleft(%20I%20%2B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cvarepsilon%20f(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t)%2C%20t)%20%2B%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BO%7D(%5C%5Cvarepsilon%5E2)%20%2B%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BO%7D(%5C%5Cvarepsilon%5E3)%20%2B%20%5C%5Cdots%20%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%20-%5C%5Cmathrm%7Btr%7D%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Clim_%7B%5C%5Cvarepsilon%20%5C%5Cto%200%5E%2B%7D%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D%7D%20f(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t)%2C%20t)%20%2B%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BO%7D(%5C%5Cvarepsilon)%20%2B%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BO%7D(%5C%5Cvarepsilon%5E2)%20%2B%20%5C%5Cdots%20%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%20-%5C%5Cmathrm%7Btr%7D%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D%7D%20f(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t)%2C%20t)%20%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F52679cc1478cf3183a38fb117a879523.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22aSWoz%22%7D"></card></p><h2 data-lake-id="DqtN0" id="DqtN0" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="ub6d5e91a" id="ub6d5e91a">🦨</span><span data-lake-id="u185ba3aa" id="u185ba3aa"> 𝐶𝑜𝑛𝑛𝑒𝑐𝑡𝑖𝑜𝑛 𝑡𝑜 𝐹𝑜𝑘𝑘𝑒𝑟-𝑃𝑙𝑎𝑛𝑐𝑘 𝑎𝑛𝑑 𝐿𝑖𝑜𝑢𝑣𝑖𝑙𝑙𝑒 𝑃𝐷𝐸𝑠</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u9a376da0" id="u9a376da0"><strong><span data-lake-id="u5aa42fd8" id="u5aa42fd8" style="color: #70000D">Fokker–Planck 方程是一类著名的偏微分方程，用于描述随机微分方程所对应的概率密度函数如何随时间演化</span></strong></p><ul list="udb6a7cda"><li fid="u90857465" data-lake-id="u3d5ebebd" id="u3d5ebebd"><span data-lake-id="ua42791f0" id="ua42791f0">本文将瞬时变量替换公式与 Fokker–Planck 方程的一个特殊情形联系起来：当扩散项为零时，Fokker–Planck 方程退化为 Liouville 方程。与瞬时变量替换公式中的设定类似，令</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z(t)%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5ED%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9d126d5528fb1b3469a98273b98418e6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22eec1C%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u78b0117a" id="u78b0117a">随时间按照</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7Bdz(t)%7D%7Bdt%7D%3Df(z(t)%2Ct)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffeb1d0e78e961547a53441a236e2a7ff.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LypUl%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="udac020ce" id="udac020ce">动力学演化。则 Liouville 方程以偏微分方程的形式描述密度</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F07bed68cf19b76db3d1c78b92f23feb2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22GJAE6%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uda5c55ee" id="uda5c55ee">在空间中某一固定位置处的变化</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u51758540" id="u51758540" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboxed%7B%5Cn%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20p(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D%2C%20t)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20t%7D%20%3D%20-%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5ED%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D_i%7D%20%5Bf_i(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D%2C%20t)%20p(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D%2C%20t)%5D%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F77e1244f9e3becea039709e636b4fb98.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UNKuf%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u918945dd"><li fid="u688adf8b" data-lake-id="u790a0f4e" id="u790a0f4e"><span data-lake-id="u2357126e" id="u2357126e">上式并不容易直接使用，因为它需要计算</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20p(z%2Ct)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20z%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Feb95743c62445f11dc1401a9a9d56cbb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ja0XC%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u25517bcb" id="u25517bcb">这类关于空间变量的偏导数，而这些偏导通常需要通过有限差分方法近似。因此，不再在空间中的固定点上评估</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p(%5C%5Ccdot%2Ct)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa64a2cda2489816d2822bbabc5eceba1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22H6tyz%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ufb6c0d55" id="ufb6c0d55">，而是沿着某个粒子的运动轨迹</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z(t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf52d701ecffcd4192ff93163a7d8607.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22HdtCY%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7d42026c" id="u7d42026c">来考察密度的变化</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u73f6d27d" id="u73f6d27d" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboxed%7B%5Cn%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20p(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t)%2C%20t)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20t%7D%20%26%3D%20%5C%5Cunderbrace%7B%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20p(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t)%2C%20t)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t)%7D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20t%7D%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bpartial%20derivative%20from%20first%20argument%2C%20%7D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t)%7D%20%2B%20%5C%5Cunderbrace%7B%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20p(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t)%2C%20t)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20t%7D%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bpartial%20derivative%20from%20second%20argument%2C%20%7D%20t%7D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%20%5C%5Ccancel%7B%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5ED%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20p(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t)%2C%20t)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D_i(t)%7D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D_i(t)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20t%7D%7D%20-%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5ED%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20f_i(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t)%2C%20t)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D_i%7D%20p(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t)%2C%20t)%20-%20%5C%5Ccancel%7B%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5ED%20f_i(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t)%2C%20t)%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20p(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t)%2C%20t)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D_i(t)%7D%7D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%20-%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5ED%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20f_i(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t)%2C%20t)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D_i%7D%20p(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t)%2C%20t)%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F559285326bae694e9044263d24096b9d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bjUGE%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u918945dd" start="2"><li fid="u688adf8b" data-lake-id="u5ea36963" id="u5ea36963"><span data-lake-id="u7037b0a1" id="u7037b0a1">进一步对该式取对数，即可得到瞬时变量替换公式</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u71ead333" id="u71ead333" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboxed%7B%5Cn%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Clog%20p(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t)%2C%20t)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20t%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7Bp(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t)%2C%20t)%7D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20p(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t)%2C%20t)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20t%7D%20%3D%20-%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5ED%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20f_i(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t)%2C%20t)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D_i%7D%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F294c7f6b4f64f3c6d25143c352173a59.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WX2TD%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u918945dd" start="3"><li fid="u688adf8b" data-lake-id="u6a6339b0" id="u6a6339b0"><span data-lake-id="uc3cb4e08" id="uc3cb4e08">可以与状态轨迹</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20z(t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe9d339506628748127dd4eb314427772.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qcsTR%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucb1123b6" id="ucb1123b6">结合，形成一个维度为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22D%2B1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F371d221479ad997436b8cb5265b77229.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hcOmz%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u85dd395c" id="u85dd395c">的常微分方程系统</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u4204cbb5" id="u4204cbb5" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboxed%7B%5Cn%5C%5Cfrac%7Bd%7D%7Bdt%7D%20%5C%5Cbegin%7Bbmatrix%7D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t)%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%20%5C%5Clog%20p(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t)%2C%20t)%20%5C%5Cend%7Bbmatrix%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cbegin%7Bbmatrix%7D%20f(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t)%2C%20t)%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%20-%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5ED%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20f_i(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t)%2C%20t)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20t%7D%20%5C%5Cend%7Bbmatrix%7D%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd21c7e9ffd76237b4d92929d5c6dc51f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UIeiw%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ua68abcde" id="ua68abcde"><strong><span data-lake-id="ubec923d7" id="ubec923d7" style="color: #00346B">与 Fokker–Planck 方程和 Liouville 方程相比，瞬时变量替换公式在实际计算中更具实用性。原因在于，它可以被更容易地数值求解：只需要在跟踪轨迹</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20z(t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe9d339506628748127dd4eb314427772.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22y8umJ%22%7D" style="color: #00346B"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u98a4e841" id="u98a4e841" style="color: #00346B">的基础上额外维护一个标量状态，即对数密度</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clog%20p(z(t)%2Ct)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc4d4ee100d28575a5d7cdf7cf2f5db42.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vBzy1%22%7D" style="color: #00346B"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ubffaf215" id="ubffaf215" style="color: #00346B">。相比之下，基于有限差分近似求解 Liouville 方程的方法通常需要在整个状态空间上构造网格，而网格规模会随维度</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1823cfcccf2f38406940e7f01cbf3d9a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22HYvcz%22%7D" style="color: #00346B"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u839cc212" id="u839cc212" style="color: #00346B">呈指数级增长</span></strong></p><h2 data-lake-id="JiMO9" id="JiMO9" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="ud6cd2baa" id="ud6cd2baa">🐇</span><span data-lake-id="ue72b8632" id="ue72b8632"> </span><span data-lake-id="u43c3e714" id="u43c3e714" style="color: #000000">𝑨 𝑴𝒐𝒅𝒆𝒓𝒏 𝑷𝒓𝒐𝒐𝒇 𝒐𝒇 𝒕𝒉𝒆 𝑨𝒅𝒋𝒐𝒊𝒏𝒕 𝑴𝒆𝒕𝒉𝒐𝒅</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u9fa9af91" id="u9fa9af91"><span data-lake-id="u10f68ea8" id="u10f68ea8">令</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20z(t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe9d339506628748127dd4eb314427772.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22k9IRA%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3f3ef5b5" id="u3f3ef5b5">满足微分方程</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7Bdz(t)%7D%7Bdt%7D%3Df(z(t)%2Ct%2C%5C%5Ctheta)%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7595f1969339b35ea33d5406493771f5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22e7oMT%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5b59932c" id="u5b59932c">其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8bd6ababe28124a7755c347ae7cb0e6f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hCmNo%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u17af5ccb" id="u17af5ccb">表示模型参数。证明：若定义伴随状态为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22a(t)%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7BdL%7D%7Bdz(t)%7D%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fca9ee67b719a68935b1d5cc80084e455.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22aWKDc%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua90b3ed4" id="ua90b3ed4">则该伴随状态满足如下微分方程</span></p><p data-lake-id="uac331ac3" id="uac331ac3" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7Bd%5C%5Cmathbf%7Ba%7D(t)%7D%7Bdt%7D%20%3D%20-%5C%5Cmathbf%7Ba%7D(t)%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20f(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t)%2C%20t%2C%20%5C%5Ctheta)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t)%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6f004373a3a84ee8b685211a9cc60509.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lwO4j%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u857d67e3" id="u857d67e3"><span data-lake-id="u15ae93cb" id="u15ae93cb">伴随状态可以理解为损失函数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20L%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F97a65d824ef5766184877c3f711d3e69.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22r5bdD%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7cf26ab9" id="u7cf26ab9">关于指定时刻</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd99979941e2b40b5ffd75f89c83e37b4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AsrNw%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3c3a432c" id="u3c3a432c">处隐藏状态的梯度。在标准神经网络中，隐藏层</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20h_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F37396365e51802bf3561d2d9dc2d0759.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MY9Pe%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3e420ddd" id="u3e420ddd">的梯度可由下一层</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22h_%7Bt%2B1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F434b4862a1e22cd62eb6139db697d4d4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QUE0n%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u474779cf" id="u474779cf">的梯度通过链式法则得到：</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7BdL%7D%7Bd%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bh%7D_t%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7BdL%7D%7Bd%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bh%7D_%7Bt%2B1%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bd%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bh%7D_%7Bt%2B1%7D%7D%7Bd%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bh%7D_t%7D.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe1fd9feefadd298216ebc0754d22e960.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lDleY%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5f54736f" id="u5f54736f">对于连续隐藏状态而言，经过一个无穷小时间增量</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cvarepsilon%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc57c5f0e31d8960d9406bb149fced9e0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zvpDL%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u613fd206" id="u613fd206">后，状态的变化可以表示为</span></p><p data-lake-id="uc4bae339" id="uc4bae339" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t%2B%5C%5Cvarepsilon)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cint_t%5E%7Bt%2B%5C%5Cvarepsilon%7D%20f(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t)%2C%20t%2C%20%5C%5Ctheta)dt%20%2B%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t)%20%3D%20T_%5C%5Cvarepsilon(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t)%2C%20t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe65f5b4998889c6a11ac966f457fe3f8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22myLT0%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u3289ce76" id="u3289ce76" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7BdL%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t)%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7BdL%7D%7Bd%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t%2B%5C%5Cvarepsilon)%7D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bd%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t%2B%5C%5Cvarepsilon)%7D%7Bd%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t)%7D%20%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bor%7D%20%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Ba%7D(t)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Ba%7D(t%2B%5C%5Cvarepsilon)%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20T_%5C%5Cvarepsilon(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t)%2C%20t)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t)%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Faad0fdb0bf74a8ce23c7de863bfa1246.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22FVJBV%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u656c167e" id="u656c167e"><span data-lake-id="ue89841c9" id="ue89841c9">从导数定义出发证明伴随方程</span></p><p data-lake-id="u00fdf836" id="u00fdf836" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cfrac%7Bd%5C%5Cmathbf%7Ba%7D(t)%7D%7Bdt%7D%20%26%3D%20%5C%5Clim_%7B%5C%5Cvarepsilon%20%5C%5Cto%200%5E%2B%7D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Ba%7D(t%2B%5C%5Cvarepsilon)%20-%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Ba%7D(t)%7D%7B%5C%5Cvarepsilon%7D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%20%5C%5Clim_%7B%5C%5Cvarepsilon%20%5C%5Cto%200%5E%2B%7D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Ba%7D(t%2B%5C%5Cvarepsilon)%20-%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Ba%7D(t%2B%5C%5Cvarepsilon)%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t)%7D%20T_%5C%5Cvarepsilon(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t))%7D%7B%5C%5Cvarepsilon%7D%20%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Ctext%7B(by%20Eq%2038)%7D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%20%5C%5Clim_%7B%5C%5Cvarepsilon%20%5C%5Cto%200%5E%2B%7D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Ba%7D(t%2B%5C%5Cvarepsilon)%20-%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Ba%7D(t%2B%5C%5Cvarepsilon)%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t)%7D%20(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t)%20%2B%20%5C%5Cvarepsilon%20f(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t)%2C%20t%2C%20%5C%5Ctheta)%20%2B%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BO%7D(%5C%5Cvarepsilon%5E2))%7D%7B%5C%5Cvarepsilon%7D%20%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Ctext%7B(Taylor%20series%20around%20%7D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t)%5C%5Ctext%7B)%7D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%20%5C%5Clim_%7B%5C%5Cvarepsilon%20%5C%5Cto%200%5E%2B%7D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Ba%7D(t%2B%5C%5Cvarepsilon)%20-%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Ba%7D(t%2B%5C%5Cvarepsilon)%20%5C%5Cleft(%20I%20%2B%20%5C%5Cvarepsilon%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20f(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t)%2C%20t%2C%20%5C%5Ctheta)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t)%7D%20%2B%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BO%7D(%5C%5Cvarepsilon%5E2)%20%5C%5Cright)%7D%7B%5C%5Cvarepsilon%7D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%20%5C%5Clim_%7B%5C%5Cvarepsilon%20%5C%5Cto%200%5E%2B%7D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B-%5C%5Cvarepsilon%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Ba%7D(t%2B%5C%5Cvarepsilon)%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20f(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t)%2C%20t%2C%20%5C%5Ctheta)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t)%7D%20%2B%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BO%7D(%5C%5Cvarepsilon%5E2)%7D%7B%5C%5Cvarepsilon%7D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%20%5C%5Clim_%7B%5C%5Cvarepsilon%20%5C%5Cto%200%5E%2B%7D%20-%5C%5Cmathbf%7Ba%7D(t%2B%5C%5Cvarepsilon)%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20f(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t)%2C%20t%2C%20%5C%5Ctheta)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t)%7D%20%2B%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BO%7D(%5C%5Cvarepsilon)%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%20-%5C%5Cmathbf%7Ba%7D(t)%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20f(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t)%2C%20t%2C%20%5C%5Ctheta)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t)%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F892dd2248f39733be6bc774b277fdcf5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22E0IGi%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ub2cd9009" id="ub2cd9009"><span data-lake-id="u96986bad" id="u96986bad">在离散神经网络中，梯度从最后一层向前逐层传播；类似地，在 ODE 系统中，伴随状态也需要沿时间反方向求解。若损失函数仅依赖于最后时刻</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20t_N%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3f3de740cae9cd2c6c60cdf2f55a52c1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JEvzA%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u18b42462" id="u18b42462">的状态，则可在终点处设定伴随状态的初始条件</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22a(t_N)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7BdL%7D%7Bdz(t_N)%7D.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F698e4081c8df9642d7761a537a5a2bb0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22F1aiu%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6edc4408" id="u6edc4408">随后，通过沿时间反向积分伴随方程，可以得到任意时刻的状态梯度，包括初始时刻</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F120ecc98af8b35809bffc3741ac52f86.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22KdQbc%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc340b23d" id="uc340b23d">处的梯度：</span></p><p data-lake-id="u5db4babf" id="u5db4babf" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboxed%7B%5Cn%5C%5Cunderbrace%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Ba%7D(t_N)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7BdL%7D%7Bd%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t_N)%7D%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Binitial%20condition%20of%20adjoint%20diffeq.%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cunderbrace%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Ba%7D(t_0)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Ba%7D(t_N)%20%2B%20%5C%5Cint_%7Bt_N%7D%5E%7Bt_0%7D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bd%5C%5Cmathbf%7Ba%7D(t)%7D%7Bdt%7D%20dt%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Ba%7D(t_N)%20-%20%5C%5Cint_%7Bt_N%7D%5E%7Bt_0%7D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Ba%7D(t)%5ET%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20f(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t)%2C%20t%2C%20%5C%5Ctheta)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t)%7D%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bgradient%20wrt.%20initial%20value%7D%7D%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf808444ef53802332c80b241f88448c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jwfJn%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u8bf53617" id="u8bf53617"><span data-lake-id="u31041c98" id="u31041c98">这里假设损失函数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20L%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F97a65d824ef5766184877c3f711d3e69.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22iZ9Vk%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf795cabe" id="uf795cabe">仅依赖于最后一个时间点</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t_N%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb88bbacc8f37b7cccfafe43b1dbee8bb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PoLPY%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uac16d694" id="uac16d694">。如果</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20L%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F97a65d824ef5766184877c3f711d3e69.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22dzhiq%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u37bcd79d" id="u37bcd79d">还依赖于中间时刻</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t_1%2Ct_2%2C%5C%5Cldots%2Ct_%7BN-1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F19535656930c0f37bafa1484c7bcc043.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22RifCl%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="udb1bc2e4" id="udb1bc2e4">的状态，则可以在每个相邻时间区间上重复执行伴随反向传播步骤，即依次在区间</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5Bt_%7BN-1%7D%2Ct_N%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe7464f65c6920fc0c26fbef5a32525ee.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PDdwE%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6328dbc3" id="u6328dbc3">、</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5Bt_%7BN-2%7D%2Ct_%7BN-1%7D%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc564ca8746039763303483934e60c4e6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IKq4K%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u09ffc942" id="u09ffc942">等上反向求解，并将各区间得到的梯度进行累加</span></p><p data-lake-id="u01e1fdbb" id="u01e1fdbb"><span data-lake-id="u7c4c7e06" id="u7c4c7e06">接下来，可以将上述伴随方程推广到参数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8bd6ababe28124a7755c347ae7cb0e6f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22iU9PS%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1e9981d4" id="u1e9981d4">以及积分起止时间</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20t_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5dc071db6ef391e8f30b9e7aee482ac7.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bK6VW%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1d360d6e" id="u1d360d6e">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20t_N%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3f3de740cae9cd2c6c60cdf2f55a52c1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xYIxj%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u32eabe90" id="u32eabe90">的梯度计算。将</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fed5a4aa5e092e303a69c608582c70db9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22dMkwF%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uecdcb4e1" id="uecdcb4e1">视为关于时间不变的状态变量，同时将时间</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd99979941e2b40b5ffd75f89c83e37b4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22sRiIB%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7338351c" id="u7338351c">本身也作为一个状态变量。于是有</span></p><p data-lake-id="u4510d111" id="u4510d111" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Ctheta(t)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20t%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7B0%7D%20%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bdt(t)%7D%7Bdt%7D%20%3D%201%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdb1433b3b140b1b9031f5dda1cf933c0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BArTB%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u133c8892"><li fid="ua9629bbf" data-lake-id="uc9f51d76" id="uc9f51d76"><span data-lake-id="u7ec7c654" id="u7ec7c654">将它们与</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20z(t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe9d339506628748127dd4eb314427772.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22sl1j4%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3044f0d4" id="u3044f0d4">组合起来，可以构造增广状态及其对应的微分方程</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u8798a36f" id="u8798a36f" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7Bd%7D%7Bdt%7D%20%5C%5Cbegin%7Bbmatrix%7D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%20%5C%5Ctheta%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%20t%20%5C%5Cend%7Bbmatrix%7D%20(t)%20%3D%20f_%7Baug%7D(%5B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D%2C%20%5C%5Ctheta%2C%20t%5D)%20%3A%3D%20%5C%5Cbegin%7Bbmatrix%7D%20f(%5B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D%2C%20%5C%5Ctheta%2C%20t%5D)%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7B0%7D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%201%20%5C%5Cend%7Bbmatrix%7D%20%2C%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Ba%7D_%7Baug%7D%20%3A%3D%20%5C%5Cbegin%7Bbmatrix%7D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Ba%7D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Ba%7D_%5C%5Ctheta%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Ba%7D_t%20%5C%5Cend%7Bbmatrix%7D%20%2C%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Ba%7D_%5C%5Ctheta(t)%20%3A%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7BdL%7D%7Bd%5C%5Ctheta(t)%7D%20%2C%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Ba%7D_t(t)%20%3A%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7BdL%7D%7Bdt(t)%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd3a477430d471b75ed009569521885b5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JLHxT%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="uf9308725"><li fid="ud23c54f9" data-lake-id="u26684759" id="u26684759"><span data-lake-id="uaf483483" id="uaf483483">此时，增广动力学函数的雅可比矩阵具有如下形式</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u1e62a545" id="u1e62a545" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20f_%7Baug%7D%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D%2C%20%5C%5Ctheta%2C%20t%5D%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cbegin%7Bbmatrix%7D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20f%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D%7D%20%26%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20f%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Ctheta%7D%20%26%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20f%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20t%7D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7B0%7D%20%26%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7B0%7D%20%26%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7B0%7D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7B0%7D%20%26%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7B0%7D%20%26%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7B0%7D%20%5C%5Cend%7Bbmatrix%7D%20(t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd0d1c168a5b4258d2595b367279783ad.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22iGCqJ%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="uf9308725" start="2"><li fid="ud23c54f9" data-lake-id="ud9ceac7e" id="ud9ceac7e"><span data-lake-id="ue3c5bf47" id="ue3c5bf47">其中每一个 0 都表示维度相匹配的零矩阵。将该雅可比矩阵代入伴随方程，可以得到</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u58fb780b" id="u58fb780b" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7Bd%5C%5Cmathbf%7Ba%7D_%7Baug%7D(t)%7D%7Bdt%7D%20%3D%20-%20%5B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Ba%7D(t)%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Ba%7D_%5C%5Ctheta(t)%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Ba%7D_t(t)%5D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20f_%7Baug%7D%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D%2C%20%5C%5Ctheta%2C%20t%5D%7D%20(t)%20%3D%20-%20%5B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Ba%7D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20f%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Ba%7D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20f%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Ctheta%7D%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Ba%7D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20f%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20t%7D%5D%20(t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff466fe6864b6321909c6e87d16bb604a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VXXwh%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="uf9308725" start="3"><li fid="ud23c54f9" data-lake-id="u31a9b630" id="u31a9b630"><span data-lake-id="uc0713cb3" id="uc0713cb3">其中，第一项正是前面已经得到的伴随微分方程；第二项可以用于计算损失函数关于参数的总梯度。通过在整个时间区间上积分该项，并设定终点条件</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22a_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(t_N)%3D0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb90d045ce5f70462520816c18446db18.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YJffB%22%7D"></card></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ub3cceefa" id="ub3cceefa" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7BdL%7D%7Bd%5C%5Ctheta%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Ba%7D_%5C%5Ctheta(t_0)%20%3D%20-%20%5C%5Cint_%7Bt_N%7D%5E%7Bt_0%7D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Ba%7D(t)%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20f(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t)%2C%20t%2C%20%5C%5Ctheta)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Ctheta%7D%20dt%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc8abc58730c96041a32bfbbc4f673614.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22EqElN%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u691d549f"><li fid="u87e1231d" data-lake-id="udc2d0a81" id="udc2d0a81"><span data-lake-id="ue841e3db" id="ue841e3db">最后，还可以得到损失函数关于积分终止时间</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20t_N%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3f3de740cae9cd2c6c60cdf2f55a52c1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IUWit%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4d472d1f" id="u4d472d1f">和起始时间</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20t_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5dc071db6ef391e8f30b9e7aee482ac7.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CmgMc%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc18a6c2b" id="uc18a6c2b">的梯度</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u85074494" id="u85074494" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7BdL%7D%7Bdt_N%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Ba%7D(t_N)%20f(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t_N)%2C%20t_N%2C%20%5C%5Ctheta)%20%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cfrac%7BdL%7D%7Bdt_0%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Ba%7D_t(t_0)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Ba%7D_t(t_N)%20-%20%5C%5Cint_%7Bt_N%7D%5E%7Bt_0%7D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Ba%7D(t)%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20f(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t)%2C%20t%2C%20%5C%5Ctheta)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20t%7D%20dt%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2f7701f28d2c4a9fa390501689f5eb6f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22giXzm%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u14c86623" id="u14c86623"><span data-lake-id="u53842472" id="u53842472">因此，结合状态伴随方程、初始状态梯度、参数梯度以及时间边界梯度的表达式，就可以得到初值问题 ODE 求解器所有可能输入变量的梯度。伴随敏感度方法不仅能够反向传播到初始状态，还能够同时处理模型参数以及积分区间端点的梯度，从而为连续深度模型的端到端训练提供完整的微分机制</span></p><p data-lake-id="u5083b306" id="u5083b306" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1777554092724-73b9bad9-b696-49b3-a231-7a963f39e732.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u7de0c415-67ef-468f-b481-10bbbda5f19%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u34d723a2-e57b-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A873.9091186523438%2C%22height%22%3A272%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A133486%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1269%2C%22originHeight%22%3A395%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.375%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22NPUT%3ADVNAMICSPARAMETERS0STARTTIMETN%2CSTOPIMET%2CFINALSTATEZ(T%2CLOSSGRADIENTOL%2FOZL(T)%22%2C%22x%22%3A17%2C%22y%22%3A68%2C%22width%22%3A1213%2C%22height%22%3A31%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LGORITHM2COMPLETEREVERSE-MODEDERIVATIVEOFANODEINITIALVALUEPROBLEM%22%2C%22x%22%3A18%2C%22y%22%3A16%2C%22width%22%3A1009%2C%22height%22%3A31%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DEFNEDYNAMICSONAUGMENTEDSTAT%22%2C%22x%22%3A763%2C%22y%22%3A208%2C%22width%22%3A478%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DEFAUG_DYNAMICS(Z(T)%2CA(T)%2C.%2C%2CT%2C0).%22%2C%22x%22%3A43%2C%22y%22%3A205%2C%22width%22%3A496%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22COMPUTEVECTOR-JACOBLANPRODUCTS%22%2C%22x%22%3A775%2C%22y%22%3A247%2C%22width%22%3A484%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RETURNF(Z(T)%2CT%2CO)%2C-A(T)%E5%88%86%22%2C%22x%22%3A85%2C%22y%22%3A245%2C%22width%22%3A386%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22-.F()%2C%2C0%22%2C%22x%22%3A57%2C%22y%22%3A112%2C%22width%22%3A329%2C%22height%22%3A36%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22-ODESOLVE(SO%2CAUG_DYNAMICS%2CT1%2CTO%22%2C%22x%22%3A302%2C%22y%22%3A292%2C%22width%22%3A523%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DEFNEINITIALAUGMENTEDSTATE%22%2C%22x%22%3A871%2C%22y%22%3A164%2C%22width%22%3A382%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22-()%2C00%E4%B8%80%22%2C%22x%22%3A77%2C%22y%22%3A160%2C%22width%22%3A334%2C%22height%22%3A34%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RETURNALLGRADIENTS%22%2C%22x%22%3A996%2C%22y%22%3A333%2C%22width%22%3A259%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22COMPUTEGRADLIENTW.R.TT%22%2C%22x%22%3A903%2C%22y%22%3A119%2C%22width%22%3A353%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SOLVEREVERSE-TIMEODE%22%2C%22x%22%3A925%2C%22y%22%3A289%2C%22width%22%3A332%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OZ(TOOEOTOOT%22%2C%22x%22%3A123%2C%22y%22%3A348%2C%22width%22%3A222%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220%2C%22%2C%22x%22%3A50%2C%22y%22%3A288%2C%22width%22%3A159%2C%22height%22%3A31%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%2C%2C%E5%93%81%E4%B8%80C%22%2C%22x%22%3A187%2C%22y%22%3A287%2C%22width%22%3A201%2C%22height%22%3A31%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22F(Z(T1)%2CT1%2C6%22%2C%22x%22%3A215%2C%22y%22%3A114%2C%22width%22%3A165%2C%22height%22%3A32%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22)%E5%93%81%3A%E4%B8%80A%E5%8A%B1%22%2C%22x%22%3A402%2C%22y%22%3A249%2C%22width%22%3A236%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RETURN%22%2C%22x%22%3A21%2C%22y%22%3A338%2C%22width%22%3A104%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OLLOL%22%2C%22x%22%3A178%2C%22y%22%3A329%2C%22width%22%3A178%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%3FO0OTOJ%22%2C%22x%22%3A210%2C%22y%22%3A306%2C%22width%22%3A138%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OZ(TO)%22%2C%22x%22%3A122%2C%22y%22%3A308%2C%22width%22%3A100%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OL%22%2C%22x%22%3A124%2C%22y%22%3A332%2C%22width%22%3A62%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%80OZ(T)%22%2C%22x%22%3A97%2C%22y%22%3A128%2C%22width%22%3A111%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23e9e9e9%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u6a245bcf%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><h1 data-lake-id="wEN8A" id="wEN8A" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u91c5e1d0" id="u91c5e1d0">🐼</span><span data-lake-id="uf70a09ec" id="uf70a09ec"> 𝐅𝐅𝐉𝐎𝐑𝐃</span></h1><p data-lake-id="u7225ff38" id="u7225ff38"><strong><span data-lake-id="u9dc47968" id="u9dc47968">可逆生成模型通过一个易于求逆的神经网络，将来自简单分布的样本点映射到复杂分布</span></strong></p><ul list="u2a31c8a3"><li fid="u48b9b72f" data-lake-id="u876f61cd" id="u876f61cd"><span data-lake-id="u3ffcf7b7" id="u3ffcf7b7">典型代表包括 NICE、Real NVP 和 Glow。这类模型易于采样，并且可以通过变量替换公式进行最大似然训练。然而，为避免计算雅可比行列式时出现</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22O(D%5E3)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbcf0a67d50f1b59da31514ec89f8aad8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TID48%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8e074ff4" id="u8e074ff4">的高昂代价，模型架构往往必须受到一些不自然的限制，例如对维度进行划分，或者使用秩一权重矩阵</span></li><li fid="u48b9b72f" data-lake-id="ubb7a426b" id="ubb7a426b"><span data-lake-id="u46e236c1" id="u46e236c1">近期，Chen et al. 提出连续归一化流，使用常微分方程来定义从潜变量到数据的映射。在该模型中，似然可以通过迹运算进行计算，其计算复杂度为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22O(D%5E2)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F95f022af56d3eb5da44cb8403f89732c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AkdQd%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u68d9e113" id="u68d9e113">。这使得模型可以采用更加灵活的网络结构，但这种灵活性仍然是受限的</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uc7d60b6d" id="uc7d60b6d"><strong><span data-lake-id="u32b90074" id="u32b90074" style="color: #DF2A3F">作者利用 Hutchinson 迹估计器，对对数密度给出一个可扩展的无偏估计。由此得到的模型是一类连续时间可逆生成模型，它既能够实现无偏密度估计和单次前向采样，又允许使用不受特殊结构限制的神经网络架构。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u4bc35db0" id="u4bc35db0">此外实现基于 GPU 的自适应 ODE 求解器，以便在现代硬件上训练和评估此类模型。将该方法称为 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u22007504" id="u22007504">Free-form Jacobian of Reversible Dynamics，简称 FFJORD</span></strong></p><h2 data-lake-id="aJzWv" id="aJzWv" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u293ea820" id="u293ea820">🐿️</span><span data-lake-id="ua244d0d3" id="ua244d0d3"> 𝐁𝐚𝐜𝐤𝐠𝐫𝐨𝐮𝐧𝐝: 𝐆𝐞𝐧𝐞𝐫𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐯𝐞 𝐌𝐨𝐝𝐞𝐥𝐬 𝐚𝐧𝐝 𝐂𝐡𝐚𝐧𝐠𝐞 𝐨𝐟 𝐕𝐚𝐫𝐢𝐚𝐛𝐥𝐞𝐬</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u5bbaf7c1" id="u5bbaf7c1"><strong><span data-lake-id="u7ced67af" id="u7ced67af">不同于直接参数化一个已经归一化的分布，变量替换公式允许我们通过一个可逆函数</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f%3A%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5ED%20%5C%5Cto%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5ED%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd9819fbed27a921936aab94c3969f1a5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QgPrK%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uebe677aa" id="uebe677aa">，将一个归一化的基础分布</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_z(z)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F842a454ef15935e3e4db23b26239b863.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Hi7wW%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u5af60f76" id="u5af60f76">进行变换，从而隐式地定义一个复杂的归一化分布</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_x(x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Feb50ee59c2b8da167982384bef2a43e2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VVh0y%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u666facb3" id="u666facb3">。给定随机变量</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z%20%5C%5Csim%20p_z(z)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F67bb930191965416fb5967b56fd5e277.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Oqsqc%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6ad910f0" id="u6ad910f0">，令</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x%20%3D%20f(z)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0370bf7c8927158d64c48fee81543f68.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vNG5r%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9fb1c62c" id="u9fb1c62c">，则</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F712ecf7894348e92d8779c3ee87eeeb0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ShmSh%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6ab1f5cf" id="u6ab1f5cf">的对数密度满足：</span></p><p data-lake-id="uf90b3705" id="uf90b3705" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboxed%7B%5Cn%5C%5Clog%20p_x(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%20%3D%20%5C%5Clog%20p_z(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D)%20-%20%5C%5Clog%20%5C%5Cleft%7C%20%5C%5Cdet%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20f(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cright%7C%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc3dbe909354359a760b3c38d68732aff.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZrysY%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ub54afd37" id="ub54afd37"><span data-lake-id="u755ec468" id="u755ec468">其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20f(z)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20z%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9c53734cdd08d2bb76a22933e6c97e4f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Hkmg0%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua9366aba" id="ua9366aba">是函数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20f%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F93d9083c18a4e52919e9c11f99836398.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lsyaH%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3aa7db8f" id="u3aa7db8f">的雅可比矩阵。一般而言，计算该雅可比矩阵的对数行列式需要</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20O(D%5E3)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F01416da4537b843cc115fc2287eef9f3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZJhP0%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7af159f6" id="u7af159f6">的时间复杂度。大量研究致力于设计受限的神经网络结构，使雅可比行列式的计算更加可处理。这些方法大体可以分为以下三类</span></p><ul list="ubfd7e6e2"><li fid="u9b0f615a" data-lake-id="u0d8f7050" id="u0d8f7050"><strong><span data-lake-id="u04a6ba7f" id="u04a6ba7f">归一化流</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u2384b6b5" id="u2384b6b5">：通过限制函数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20f%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F93d9083c18a4e52919e9c11f99836398.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22GFU5s%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8fb788e5" id="u8fb788e5">的具体形式，可以利用多种行列式恒等式来降低计算复杂度。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u192d57b7" id="u192d57b7" style="color: #270070">这类模型通常不能作为从数据中学习的生成模型进行训练，因为它们不具备可处理的逆映射</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f%5E%7B-1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc1d0e66a76f62e2c608ff77c7c8284d2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IbnR2%22%7D" style="color: #270070"></card><span data-lake-id="u21e4849b" id="u21e4849b">。然而，它们在变分推断中可用于构造近似后验分布</span></li><li fid="u9b0f615a" data-lake-id="u199fc70a" id="u199fc70a"><strong><span data-lake-id="u1af45105" id="u1af45105">自回归变换</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ud2d60622" id="ud2d60622">：通过采用自回归模型，并为各个维度指定一个顺序，可以使函数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20f%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F93d9083c18a4e52919e9c11f99836398.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AV90V%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf735c254" id="uf735c254">的雅可比矩阵被约束为下三角矩阵。逆变换需要对</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20f%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F93d9083c18a4e52919e9c11f99836398.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zQZ7q%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u00178678" id="u00178678">进行</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1823cfcccf2f38406940e7f01cbf3d9a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QzDJJ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua0f78f25" id="ua0f78f25">次顺序计算；当维度</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1823cfcccf2f38406940e7f01cbf3d9a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DeNV7%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucb4b9a75" id="ucb4b9a75">较大时，这一代价往往难以承受</span></li><li fid="u9b0f615a" data-lake-id="ubc1b0e8b" id="ubc1b0e8b"><strong><span data-lake-id="u95abbeb0" id="u95abbeb0">分块变换</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u079cceac" id="u079cceac">：通过对维度进行划分，并在不同部分之间使用仿射变换，可以使雅可比行列式的计算变得非常高效，同时逆映射</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f%5E%7B-1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc1d0e66a76f62e2c608ff77c7c8284d2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bePLf%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u31fffd7f" id="u31fffd7f">的计算成本也可以与正向映射</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20f%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F93d9083c18a4e52919e9c11f99836398.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hbALW%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uabce8a0a" id="uabce8a0a">保持一致。这类方法允许使用卷积网络结构，在图像数据的密度估计任务中表现优异</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u7a70501f" id="u7a70501f"><strong><span data-lake-id="uf43ab0d2" id="uf43ab0d2">除基于变量替换公式进行训练的方法之外，生成建模中还存在若干其他重要路线</span></strong></p><ul list="uefb31e1e"><li fid="u6955713b" data-lake-id="u163bb7ff" id="u163bb7ff"><strong><span data-lake-id="uaa127643" id="uaa127643">生成对抗网络</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uce5799fb" id="uce5799fb">使用大规模且不受特殊结构限制的神经网络，将来自固定基础分布的样本变换为数据样本。由于这类模型缺乏闭式形式的似然函数，因此必须额外训练一个判别器模型，用于估计分布之间的散度或密度比，从而为生成器提供训练信号</span></li><li fid="u6955713b" data-lake-id="u49eaf08e" id="u49eaf08e"><strong><span data-lake-id="u2a3f9df4" id="u2a3f9df4">自回归模型</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u63d3bb78" id="u63d3bb78">直接利用概率乘法法则，将联合分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20p(x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fae1d52dca139f1c1ac166880dec203c2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OedoZ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub7947bbf" id="ub7947bbf">表示为一系列显式条件分布的乘积。这类模型能够精确地给出数据似然，但在采样时通常至少需要</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20O(D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F47fbdbd0298d9356c49db1760eb774f4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VbW5n%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u28b2d6fd" id="u28b2d6fd">次顺序计算，因此采样效率较低</span></li><li fid="u6955713b" data-lake-id="u48be84aa" id="u48be84aa"><strong><span data-lake-id="ufe084f0d" id="ufe084f0d">变分自编码器</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u8a6836b0" id="u8a6836b0">使用不受特殊结构限制的神经网络来显式建模条件似然</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p(x%7Cz)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5a8fd74cf29170b52cabf8f5fe91a1c7.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22pY3Rt%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u30c5b72f" id="u30c5b72f">。然而对于边缘似然</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p(x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F01a43d844d20cf8c9a4edce9ccb6c442.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MOKKL%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8dfb1531" id="u8dfb1531">，这类模型通常只能高效地给出一个随机下界，而不能直接进行精确的似然计算</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u726b1e64" id="u726b1e64"><strong><span data-lake-id="ue58bb4f3" id="ue58bb4f3" style="color: rgb(34, 73, 254),rgb(199, 74, 168)">作者将可逆生成模型定义为这样一类模型：它们利用变量替换公式，将一个基础分布变换为模型分布，并且能够通过模型的一次前向计算同时保持高效的密度估计能力和高效的采样能力</span></strong></p><h2 data-lake-id="I0gk1" id="I0gk1" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u1c7f296d" id="u1c7f296d">🪺</span><span data-lake-id="ua58c56ba" id="ua58c56ba"> 𝐂𝐨𝐧𝐭𝐢𝐧𝐮𝐨𝐮𝐬 𝐍𝐨𝐫𝐦𝐚𝐥𝐢𝐳𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐅𝐥𝐨𝐰𝐬</span></h2><p data-lake-id="ub56fb966" id="ub56fb966"><strong><span data-lake-id="uea3610f5" id="uea3610f5">Chen et al.（2018）定义一类针对数据</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5ED%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6d6388abc98ad552dc0bce386eb48358.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22z5bFt%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uf262ea8b" id="uf262ea8b">的生成模型</span></strong></p><ul list="uf1387a74"><li fid="u7e75acb6" data-lake-id="uf24a144e" id="uf24a144e"><strong><span data-lake-id="u2f517316" id="u2f517316" style="color: #663000">该模型不再直接参数化一个显式的可逆变换映射，而是通过求解连续时间动力系统来隐式定义从基础分布到数据分布的变换</span></strong></li><li fid="u7e75acb6" data-lake-id="u79cdc279" id="u79cdc279"><span data-lake-id="u0215b4b6" id="u0215b4b6">生成过程首先从一个基础分布中采样：</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D_0%20%5C%5Csim%20p_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D_0%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D_0).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe93ddddb00bc302c2bb7c0c0c1a0d30e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22iG1qf%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue360605d" id="ue360605d">随后，给定一个由参数化函数定义的常微分方程</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20t%7D%20%3D%20f(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t)%2C%20t%3B%20%5C%5Ctheta)%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F04ddfb35cf00900fa18ef574f5a37174.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22axCLU%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6b0fba59" id="u6b0fba59">并以</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t_0)%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe42420fe273094e2f6cc551159367df8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22RZd3u%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u72dc4995" id="u72dc4995">作为初始条件求解该初值问题，从而得到数据样本</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t_1).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F61b5843e1b74b2f10df189b504445714.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22P8aIn%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uae1cabda" id="uae1cabda">这类模型被称为连续归一化流</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uf43b9978" id="uf43b9978"><strong><span data-lake-id="u83fa7466" id="u83fa7466">在该模型下，对数密度的变化满足另一个微分方程，该方程被称为瞬时变量替换公式：</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u4cca1075" id="u4cca1075" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboxed%7B%5Cn%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Clog%20p(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t))%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20t%7D%20%3D%20-%5C%5Cmathrm%7BTr%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20f%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t)%7D%5C%5Cright).%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F364495e75b74f18201914886d4807ffc.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hCkan%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u279b1d39"><li fid="ua1ecd033" data-lake-id="uf34d6ada" id="uf34d6ada"><span data-lake-id="u19e86014" id="u19e86014">在连续时间动力学的演化过程中，样本点对数密度的瞬时变化率由向量场</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20f%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F93d9083c18a4e52919e9c11f99836398.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rstZH%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua3962fd2" id="ua3962fd2">关于状态变量</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F90408528e8adc63593bd2fbf20e3e78a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xYQwF%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue7168c0a" id="ue7168c0a">的雅可比矩阵的迹决定。因此，通过沿时间积分，可以得到对数密度的总变化量：</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u64672d63" id="u64672d63" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboxed%7B%5Cn%5C%5Clog%20p(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t_1))%20%3D%20%5C%5Clog%20p(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t_0))%20-%20%5C%5Cint_%7Bt_0%7D%5E%7Bt_1%7D%20%5C%5Cmathrm%7BTr%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20f%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t)%7D%5C%5Cright)%20dt.%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Faa94f27b4c3bffaf6025bf0f45986074.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22oqdeY%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="uf92a52d2" id="uf92a52d2"><strong><span data-lake-id="uc23bb320" id="uc23bb320">给定一个数据点，通过求解一个联合初值问题，同时计算出生成该数据点的初始潜变量，以及模型赋予该数据点的对数似然</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u2d7d498b" id="u2d7d498b" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboxed%7B%5Cn%5C%5Cunderbrace%7B%5C%5Cbegin%7Bbmatrix%7D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D_0%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%20%5C%5Clog%20p(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%20-%20%5C%5Clog%20p_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D_0%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D_0)%20%5C%5Cend%7Bbmatrix%7D%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bsolutions%7D%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cbegin%7Bbmatrix%7D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%200%20%5C%5Cend%7Bbmatrix%7D%20%2B%20%5C%5Cunderbrace%7B%5C%5Cint_%7Bt_1%7D%5E%7Bt_0%7D%20%5C%5Cbegin%7Bbmatrix%7D%20f(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t)%2C%20t%3B%20%5C%5Ctheta)%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%20%5C%5Cmathrm%7BTr%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20f%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t)%7D%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Cend%7Bbmatrix%7D%20dt%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bdynamics%7D%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cunderbrace%7B%5C%5Cbegin%7Bbmatrix%7D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t_1)%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%20%5C%5Clog%20p(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%20-%20%5C%5Clog%20p(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t_1))%20%5C%5Cend%7Bbmatrix%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cbegin%7Bbmatrix%7D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%200%20%5C%5Cend%7Bbmatrix%7D%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Binitial%20values%7D%7D%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F93e02a1b45a555bdb534ffbe862af454.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kRYj3%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ufb156e39"><li fid="u3fd930df" data-lake-id="u30bb5d2a" id="u30bb5d2a"><span data-lake-id="u32c6823b" id="u32c6823b">该联合系统同时对状态变量</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F007ec715f482f0e9b10faca1b961feeb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ln8Wy%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8b208bcf" id="u8b208bcf">的动力学演化和样本对数密度的变化进行积分。由于在似然计算时已知的是终点数据</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t_1)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbc0276ae29629252cd27753caca0ac4a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ToHQ9%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4ebb5189" id="u4ebb5189">，因此需要从</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20t_1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb7b5965f6f6bece4f84ff6193add355e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QB0Mj%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4212874d" id="u4212874d">反向积分到</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F120ecc98af8b35809bffc3741ac52f86.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tZ6Bf%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u04823d31" id="u04823d31">。在得到该联合系统的解之后，再加上基础分布处的对数密度</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Clog%20p_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D_0%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D_0)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc0c41e3768b12ba3a887371effeaf2b4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22yKU4G%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4c609940" id="u4c609940">，即可得到数据点</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2adf48e1cf80858f0604d2b51eeed4b8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22n38w8%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u099c939d" id="u099c939d">在模型下的对数似然</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clog%20p(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fccadbdda6ecd213efa1afbfe01c788a9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BEwNn%22%7D"></card></li><li fid="u3fd930df" data-lake-id="u2a4adcaf" id="u2a4adcaf"><span data-lake-id="u373a760c" id="u373a760c">解存在且唯一，要求函数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20f%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F93d9083c18a4e52919e9c11f99836398.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22N4oJq%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7b936e79" id="u7b936e79">及其一阶导数满足 Lipschitz 连续性。在实践中，这一条件可以通过采用具有平滑 Lipschitz 性质的激活函数来近似满足，例如 softplus 或 tanh</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u098054f3" id="u098054f3"><strong><span data-lake-id="ud235c0c4" id="ud235c0c4">CNF 的训练目标是最大化对数似然。该目标依赖于一个初值问题的解，而该初值问题的动力学函数由参数</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8bd6ababe28124a7755c347ae7cb0e6f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PTb52%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u636d1fe6" id="u636d1fe6">所刻画</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uf38d7237" id="uf38d7237">。对于任意一个作用在初值问题解上的标量损失函数，设其形式为</span></p><p data-lake-id="ucbbd3e73" id="ucbbd3e73" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboxed%7B%5CnL(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t_1))%20%3D%20L%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cint_%7Bt_0%7D%5E%7Bt_1%7D%20f(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t)%2C%20t%3B%20%5C%5Ctheta)dt%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6ad4d1578d64a71681e559e7ead7bc74.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ADI4P%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ufe08bd60"><li fid="u4c3b4cd8" data-lake-id="ub4e8cd32" id="ub4e8cd32"><span data-lake-id="u3d044018" id="u3d044018">其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t_1)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb138c0a9a3823e73571a1484ab776e68.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22KF0mY%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u661524da" id="u661524da">是由动力系统从初始状态</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t_0)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F86d60133e0bc6c2c2d6b7e2a85b283e4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22blF1D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub7c0e24a" id="ub7c0e24a">演化得到的终端状态。Pontryagin 表明，该损失函数关于参数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8bd6ababe28124a7755c347ae7cb0e6f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ENnqS%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf8ea57e7" id="uf8ea57e7">的导数同样可以表示为一个初值问题的解，其形式为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u9e081e40" id="u9e081e40" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboxed%7B%5Cn%5C%5Cfrac%7BdL%7D%7Bd%5C%5Ctheta%7D%20%3D%20-%5C%5Cint_%7Bt_1%7D%5E%7Bt_0%7D%20%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20L%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t)%7D%5C%5Cright)%5ET%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20f(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t)%2C%20t%3B%20%5C%5Ctheta)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Ctheta%7D%20dt.%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd9b8d1286720ec4ba90d41e4c94554a8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22iDgRU%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="uc868799e"><li fid="u969be578" data-lake-id="uae717d1f" id="uae717d1f"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22-%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20L%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t)%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdb679b9f58529fa90683c4e68c54db1a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22oS2sx%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5dd9fc8f" id="u5dd9fc8f">被称为该 ODE 的</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u846326d7" id="u846326d7">伴随状态</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u29439a59" id="u29439a59">。Chen 首先使用一个黑箱 ODE 求解器计算终端状态</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t_1)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd200b5ae81a1b038bf69b9187bcfc64a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YTV8r%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u35f21684" id="u35f21684">，随后再调用一次 ODE 求解器，从终端处的梯度</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20L%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t_1)%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F96619467d1dd47d6e4746841208aed2a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vxoIr%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9101b16b" id="u9101b16b">作为初始条件，反向求解所对应的伴随系统，从而计算损失函数关于参数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%CE%B8%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa9cdc3480702b90af16fb39b010661ca.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22SxKR3%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6fb3b269" id="u6fb3b269">的梯度。这种方法可以看作是标准反向传播算法在连续时间动力系统中的对应形式。它允许在不显式展开整个数值积分计算图的情况下，对 ODE 解进行梯度计算，并进一步结合基于梯度的优化方法，通过最大似然估计来拟合模型参数</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="yHw7W" id="yHw7W" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u6f760ea7" id="u6f760ea7">🦨</span><span data-lake-id="ub3c8a8be" id="ub3c8a8be"> 𝐒𝐜𝐚𝐥𝐚𝐛𝐥𝐞 𝐃𝐞𝐧𝐬𝐢𝐭𝐲 𝐄𝐯𝐚𝐥𝐮𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐰𝐢𝐭𝐡 𝐔𝐧𝐫𝐞𝐬𝐭𝐫𝐢𝐜𝐭𝐞𝐝 𝐀𝐫𝐜𝐡𝐢𝐭𝐞𝐜𝐭𝐮𝐫𝐞𝐬</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u87c604b5" id="u87c604b5"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub8e9fde4" id="ub8e9fde4">从离散时间动力学切换到连续时间动力学，可以将归一化流的主要计算瓶颈从</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22O(D%5E3)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbcf0a67d50f1b59da31514ec89f8aad8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22envaY%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uce7a86a8" id="uce7a86a8">降低到</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22O(D%5E2)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F95f022af56d3eb5da44cb8403f89732c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22g2SPg%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u5d17a946" id="u5d17a946">，代价是需要引入数值 ODE 求解器。这一变化使模型能够采用更具表达能力的网络结构</span></strong></p><ul list="ud29638fa"><li fid="ua462f428" data-lake-id="uf335742c" id="uf335742c"><span data-lake-id="u8e1e73ff" id="u8e1e73ff">在 Rezende 与 Mohamed（2015）提出的原始归一化流模型中，每一层变换只是一个仅包含单个隐藏单元的一层神经网络</span></li><li fid="ua462f428" data-lake-id="uf9724989" id="uf9724989"><span data-lake-id="u1554a3fb" id="u1554a3fb">在平面连续归一化流中，Chen et al.（2018）所使用的瞬时变换是一个包含多个隐藏单元的一层神经网络</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u89be5f5b" id="u89be5f5b"><span data-lake-id="u2ce1fc01" id="u2ce1fc01">一般而言，精确计算</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7BTr%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20f%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t)%7D%5C%5Cright)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7afe493a986b57550306c7899dd49d34.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kWWgp%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u862bfcff" id="u862bfcff">需要</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22O(D%5E2)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F95f022af56d3eb5da44cb8403f89732c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Z2yFt%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ueb2950cd" id="ueb2950cd">的计算代价，或者近似等价于对</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20f%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F93d9083c18a4e52919e9c11f99836398.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22dJS5o%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u13ca04b1" id="u13ca04b1">进行</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1823cfcccf2f38406940e7f01cbf3d9a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22SC45I%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud45c788d" id="ud45c788d">次求值的代价。这是因为雅可比矩阵对角线上的每一个元素都需要分别计算一个关于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20f%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F93d9083c18a4e52919e9c11f99836398.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UpjFE%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud1a83208" id="ud1a83208"> 的导数。有两个技巧可以帮助降低计算成本</span></p><ul list="u17df3572"><li fid="uc7dbc949" data-lake-id="ubcab8838" id="ubcab8838"><strong><span data-lake-id="uf05a6f9d" id="uf05a6f9d" style="color: rgb(34, 73, 254),rgb(199, 74, 168)">第一，利用反向模式自动微分，向量-雅可比积</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bv%7D%5ET%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20f%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe19c1ab175e2c761ad711720f86d0e67.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qTalq%22%7D" style="color: rgb(34, 73, 254),rgb(199, 74, 168)"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ucc7e6185" id="ucc7e6185" style="color: rgb(34, 73, 254),rgb(199, 74, 168)">可以以近似于一次</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F18f3c2855f0e85a1ac2257f64d917144.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uYVDt%22%7D" style="color: rgb(34, 73, 254),rgb(199, 74, 168)"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u8f754c48" id="u8f754c48" style="color: rgb(34, 73, 254),rgb(199, 74, 168)">前向计算的代价得到</span></strong></li><li fid="uc7dbc949" data-lake-id="ud6c389dd" id="ud6c389dd"><strong><span data-lake-id="uc13356d4" id="uc13356d4" style="color: rgb(244, 170, 6),rgb(229, 70, 49)">第二，可以通过将矩阵与一个噪声向量做双边乘积，来获得矩阵迹的无偏估计</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7BTr%7D(A)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bp(%5C%5Cepsilon)%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5Cepsilon%5ET%20A%20%5C%5Cepsilon%20%5C%5Cright%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F72d956dc13bc78289ab32d45d0120eed.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22HH0iC%22%7D" style="color: rgb(244, 170, 6),rgb(229, 70, 49)"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u1b64230c" id="u1b64230c" style="color: rgb(244, 170, 6),rgb(229, 70, 49)">，只要噪声向量 ϵ 的分布</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p(%5C%5Cepsilon)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F505d6fac8adc4644ba018bf8ff1b3138.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22luo01%22%7D" style="color: rgb(244, 170, 6),rgb(229, 70, 49)"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uca763663" id="uca763663" style="color: rgb(244, 170, 6),rgb(229, 70, 49)">满足</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D%5B%5C%5Cepsilon%5D%3D0%2C%20%5C%5Coperatorname%7BCov%7D(%5C%5Cepsilon)%3DI.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fef8dc40f7b0ae540590e1196c297ac12.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PhGiO%22%7D" style="color: rgb(244, 170, 6),rgb(229, 70, 49)"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u3c1832ca" id="u3c1832ca" style="color: rgb(244, 170, 6),rgb(229, 70, 49)">由该公式得到的 Monte Carlo 估计器被称为 Hutchinson 迹估计器</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ua5f1e5e7" id="ua5f1e5e7"><strong><span data-lake-id="u4f334e28" id="u4f334e28">为保证每次调用 ODE 求解器时动力学是确定性的，可以在一次 ODE 求解过程中固定同一个噪声向量</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%CF%B5%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe7917ca71f6b8bb2482a4b610efe1828.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UDNAi%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u8b597555" id="u8b597555">。这样做不会引入偏差。 常用的 p(ϵ) 选择包括标准高斯分布或 Rademacher 分布  </span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="ufefc92e7" id="ufefc92e7" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboxed%7B%5Cn%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Clog%20p(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t_1))%20%26%3D%20%5C%5Clog%20p(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t_0))%20-%20%5C%5Cint_%7Bt_0%7D%5E%7Bt_1%7D%20%5C%5Cmathrm%7BTr%7D%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20f%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t)%7D%20%5C%5Cright)%20dt%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%20%5C%5Clog%20p(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t_0))%20-%20%5C%5Cint_%7Bt_0%7D%5E%7Bt_1%7D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bp(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D)%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D%5ET%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20f%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t)%7D%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D%20%5C%5Cright%5D%20dt%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%20%5C%5Clog%20p(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t_0))%20-%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bp(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D)%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5Cint_%7Bt_0%7D%5E%7Bt_1%7D%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D%5ET%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20f%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D(t)%7D%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D%20dt%20%5C%5Cright%5D%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1fe48ab701bc11e813f344993fd4f7a1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TE0Kh%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ud7a87341" id="ud7a87341"><span data-lake-id="u65ebb8f3" id="u65ebb8f3">在动力学网络的结构中，常常会存在瓶颈层，即某些隐藏层的宽度小于输入维度。可以利用迹的循环不变性来降低 Hutchinson 估计器的方差。由于用于估计</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7BTr%7D(A)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F02b01214e1fb4e27f5113a30341b9c93.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZtSIR%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uba6cca34" id="uba6cca34">的 Hutchinson 估计器的方差渐近地与</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7CA%5C%5C%7C_F%5E2%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3491ff7b35f535d3b8b8fba1f8d26745.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PL5yA%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uedf0af36" id="uedf0af36">相关，因此可以预期，将迹估计转移到更低维的矩阵上有助于降低方差。若将动力学函数看作两个函数的复合</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f%20%3D%20g%20%5C%5Ccirc%20h(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D)%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F41054fee0b54702ce1ada0baf1351378.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hgBIF%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua03025a1" id="ua03025a1">则有</span></p><p data-lake-id="u970f5136" id="u970f5136" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboxed%7B%5Cn%5C%5Cunderbrace%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BTr%7D%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20f%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cright)%7D_%7BD%20%5C%5Ctimes%20D%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cunderbrace%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BTr%7D%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20g%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20h%7D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20h%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cright)%7D_%7BD%20%5C%5Ctimes%20D%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cunderbrace%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BTr%7D%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20h%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20g%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20h%7D%20%5C%5Cright)%7D_%7BH%20%5C%5Ctimes%20H%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bp(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D)%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D%5ET%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20h%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20g%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20h%7D%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D%20%5C%5Cright%5D.%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4afa460b9a1141b3566e192795263d90.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22nronG%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ubf1f723b" id="ubf1f723b"><strong><span data-lake-id="uddc2ec40" id="uddc2ec40" style="color: #004347">作者的完整方法结合连续时间动力学和基于 Hutchinson 迹估计器的高效对数似然估计方法，从而构造出一种可扩展的可逆生成模型。与以往方法不同，该模型不要求雅可比矩阵具有特殊结构约束，因此可以使用更加自由的神经网络架构。将该方法命名为 FFJORD</span></strong></p><ul list="ua212e502"><li fid="uac6599a5" data-lake-id="uf6eeb1c4" id="uf6eeb1c4"><span data-lake-id="uf1a3de48" id="uf1a3de48">设一次计算动力学函数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F18f3c2855f0e85a1ac2257f64d917144.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22l8ev8%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0264d301" id="u0264d301">的代价为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22O(DH)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F11f3367dc079141741aa7f3fad7940db.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YF11k%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u57795015" id="u57795015">，其中 D 表示数据维度，H 表示</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20f%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F93d9083c18a4e52919e9c11f99836398.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WTW84%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u01c0a2e6" id="u01c0a2e6">中最大隐藏层的宽度。对于传统的有限 normalizing flow，由于模型需要重复使用 L 个可逆变换，并且每个变换都需要计算雅可比行列式，因此其似然计算代价为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22O((DH%20%2B%20D%5E3)L).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3018de8a2122795ed7521253b026c2bd.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Rkfn4%22%7D"></card></li><li fid="uac6599a5" data-lake-id="u813d8e9c" id="u813d8e9c"><span data-lake-id="u2a793b6f" id="u2a793b6f">在连续归一化流 CNF 中，模型不再计算雅可比行列式，而是计算雅可比矩阵的迹，单次迹计算的复杂度从</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22O(D%5E3)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbcf0a67d50f1b59da31514ec89f8aad8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fgETZ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u23c537d0" id="u23c537d0">降低到</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22O(D%5E2)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F95f022af56d3eb5da44cb8403f89732c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DxekO%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u202c5499" id="u202c5499">。由于 ODE 求解器在积分过程中需要多次调用动力学函数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20f%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F93d9083c18a4e52919e9c11f99836398.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Z1GI9%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2c261e4f" id="u2c261e4f">，若调用次数记为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Chat%7BL%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbcf5a1e980fac5274f7c2915501986a9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zXfP4%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uce64d77e" id="uce64d77e">，则 CNF 的似然计算代价为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22O((DH%20%2B%20D%5E2)%5C%5Chat%7BL%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Feb2df85e3feb787617c108ed9ec64bdf.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LgINV%22%7D"></card></li><li fid="uac6599a5" data-lake-id="u457cdf3e" id="u457cdf3e"><span data-lake-id="u82d1930e" id="u82d1930e">FFJORD 进一步使用 Hutchinson 迹估计器来无偏估计该雅可比迹，从而避免显式计算雅可比矩阵的对角元素。这样，迹估计的维度相关成本可以从</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20O(D%5E2)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff4546b488c0678588ee4a8bc70123f11.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kxSMZ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue353bbd6" id="ue353bbd6">降低到</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22O(D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F558b5ba0caf369d997575ddaa069243c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22H16BR%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9f349a5d" id="u9f349a5d">，使得整体似然计算代价进一步降为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22O((DH%20%2B%20D)%5C%5Chat%7BL%7D).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fffaa95794720347a486feb709241e123.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fMVPt%22%7D"></card></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u45cf975a" id="u45cf975a" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1778925326002-a515f77e-775c-4226-a9d0-e7e59cdd5cbe.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u20ff47ac-573a-4b24-b4b2-066061185aa%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u3eee0dc8-7b60-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A784.125%2C%22height%22%3A319%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A192771%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A917%2C%22originHeight%22%3A373%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.375%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22KEQUIRE%3ADYNAMICSFE%2CSTARTTIMETO%2CSTOPTIMET%2CDATASAMPLESX%2CDATADIMENSION.%22%2C%22x%22%3A11%2C%22y%22%3A55%2C%22width%22%3A779%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LGORITHMIUNBIASEDSTOCHASTICLOG-DENSITYESTIMATIONUSINGTHEFFJORDMODEL%22%2C%22x%22%3A14%2C%22y%22%3A19%2C%22width%22%3A743%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22UNBIASEDESTIMATEOFIR()WITHE-E%22%2C%22x%22%3A498%2C%22y%22%3A191%2C%22width%22%3A409%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22Z0%2CAIOGP-ODEINT(FAUG%2CX%2C0%2CT0%2CT1)%22%2C%22x%22%3A34%2C%22y%22%3A273%2C%22width%22%3A355%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22E-SAMPLE_UNIT-VARIANCEX.SHAPE)%22%2C%22x%22%3A24%2C%22y%22%3A80%2C%22width%22%3A338%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CONCATENATEDYNAMICSOFSTATEANDLOG-DENSITY%22%2C%22x%22%3A468%2C%22y%22%3A225%2C%22width%22%3A437%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PCOMPUTEVECTOR-JACOBIANPRODUCTWITHAUTOMATICDIFFERENTIATION%22%2C%22x%22%3A306%2C%22y%22%3A157%2C%22width%22%3A598%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22UGMENTFWITHLOG-DENSITYDYNAMICS.%22%2C%22x%22%3A558%2C%22y%22%3A105%2C%22width%22%3A346%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ADDCHANGEINLOG-DENSITY%22%2C%22x%22%3A645%2C%22y%22%3A302%2C%22width%22%3A259%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LOGP(X)-LOGPZ(Z0)-ALOGP%22%2C%22x%22%3A30%2C%22y%22%3A302%2C%22width%22%3A292%2C